<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="2KI" style="id">2 Lengte</book>
  <para style="h">2 Lengte</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Lengte</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Lengte</para>
  <para style="mt">2 Lengte</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chuin Ahab thi nungin, Moab mite chu Israel dounan akiphin taovin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chuin Ahaziah chu Samaria'a um a-indan chungnung akalbi vang kah-a alhamangin, adammo tan ahi. Chuin thupole ho asolin ajah uva, kanatna-a konahi kadamdoh kitding hinam ti Ekron pathen Baalzebub chu gadop temun, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahinla Pakai vantil'in Tishbi mi Elijah jah-a, kipat inlang chen, Samaria lengpa thupole ho gakimupin, chule ajah uvah hitin gaseijin, Israel gamsunga Pathen umloujeh-a Ekron pathen Baalzebub donga che nahiuvem?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hijeh chun tun Pakaiyin aseije, nangma nakaltouna jalkhuna kona kumlha louva thiden teiding nahitai tin seipeh un, ati. Chuin Elijah akipatdoh tai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chuin thupole ho ahenga ahung kilekit phatnun, aman ajah uvah ibola hung kinungle pai nahiuvem? ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chuin amahon ajah-a, Mikhat eikimupi diuvin ahung touvin kajah uvah, nahinsolpao lengpa henga kinung leovin lang ajah-a, Pakaiyin Ekron pathen Baalzebub donga nacheu chu, Israel gama Pathen umloujeh hijaham? hijeh chun nangma nakaldohna jalkhuna kona kumlha louva nathiden teitei ding joh ahi ati, atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chuin aman ajah uvah, nakimupi diuva hungtouva, hiche thuho nahilpao chu itobang melpu ham? ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chuin amahon, ama mimul ahin, akonga savun konggah akigah-e, tin adonbutnuve. Chuin aman Tishbi mi Elijah ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chujouvin lengpan somnga chunga gal lamkaipa le anungjui somnga hochu ahenga asolin ahi. Chuin amapa ahenga achetouvin; chuin, vetan, ama lhangvum khatna anatouvin ahi. Chuin amapan ajah-a, Pathen mipa, lengpan hungkum suh-in tin aseije, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chuin mi somnga chunga gal lamkaipa chu Elijah'in adon butnin, keima Pathen mi kahia ahile, van'a konin mei hung lenglha henlang, nangma le nanungjui somnga hochu kavam helhen, ati. Chuin van'a konin mei ahungleng lhan, amale anungjui somnga hochu akavam heltan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aman avelin, somnga chunga gallamkai le anungjui somnga ma asol kitnin ahi. Chuin amapan adonbutnin, ajah-a, vo Pathen mipa, lengpan hungkumlha loijin ati, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chuin Elijah'in adonbutnin, ajah uvah, keima Pathen mi kahia ahile, van'a konin mei hung lenglha henlang, nangma le nanungjui somngaho kavamhen, ati. Chuin van'a konin mei ahungleng lhan, ama le anungjui somnga hochu akavam heltan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chuin aman athumvei channa-in somnga gallamkai khat anungjui somnga toh asolkitnin ahi. Chuin somnga vaipo thum channapa chu achetouvin, Elijah masanga akhupmin adilsun, ahenga ngehna aneijin, ajah-a, vo Pathen mipa, nahenga kathum ahi, keima hinkho le nasohte hicheho somngaho hinkho hi namitmun manlutah hisah-in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Vetan, van'a konin mei ahungleng lhan, somnga vaipo masa teni le anungjui somnga gelchu akavam heltan ahi. Hijeh chun kahinkho hi namitmun manlutah hisah-in, atitan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chuin Pakai vantil chun Elijah jah-a, ama toh chesuh-in; ama chu kicha hih-in, ati. Chuin ama akipat doh-in, amapa chutoh lengpa henga achesuh tai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chuin aman ajah-a, Pakaiyin hitin aseije, Israel gamsunga Ekron pathen Baalzebub donga mi nasol chu, Israel gamsunga athu dopthei Pathen umloujeh ham? hichejeh-a chu nangma nakaldohna jalkhuna kona chu nahung kumlhah tahlouhel ding, nathi teitei ding ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hitichun Elijah in asei Pakai thu bangchun ama athitai. Chule Judah te lengpa Jehoshaphat chapa Jehoram lengchan kal kum nina-in, amakhelin Jehoram alengchang tai; ajehchu aman chapa aneipoi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tun Ahaziah natohle athilbol dangho chu Israel lengte thusimbu ho-a kisuna hilouham?
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chuin ahitin ahi, Pakaiyin Elijah chu van lama chimpeija atoltou dingkon chun, Elijah chu Elisha toh Gilgal'a konin akipatdoh lhonin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chuin Elijah'in Elisha jah-a, kangeh nahi, nangma hikoma hin umdentan; ajehchu Pakaiyin Bethel'a che dingin eisole, ati. Ahin Elisha'n ajah-a, Pakai hinna le nangma hinna pana kasei ahi, keiman nadalha hihhel inge, ati. Hitichun Bethel'a achesuh lhontai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chuin Bethel'a anaum themgaoho chapate chu Elisha henga ahungdoh-un, ajah-a, Pakaiyin nangma-a kona napupa chu tunia alahdoh dinghi nahet nah-em? atiuve. Chuin aman, henge, kahenai; lung mongin umun, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chuin Elijah'in Elisha jah-a, kangeh nahi, nangma hikoma hin umdentan; ajehchu Pakaiyin Jericho'a che dingin eisole, ati. Chuin aman Pakai hinna le nangma hinna pana kasei ahi, keiman nadalha hihhel inge, ati. Hitichun Jericho'a ahung lhontai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chuin Jericho'a um themgaoho chapate chu Elisha henga ahungun, ajah-a, Pakaiyin nangma-a kona napupa chu tunia alahdoh ding ahitai ti nahet nah-em? atiuve. Chuin aman adonbutnin, henge, kahenai; lung mongin umun, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chuin Elijah'in ajah-a, kangeh nahi, umdentan; ajehchu Pakaiyin Jordan'a chedin eisole, ati. Chuin aman Pakai hinna le nangma hinna pana kasei ahi, keiman nadalha hihhel inge, ati. Chuin amani achejom kit lhontai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chuin themgaoho chapate pasal somnga acheuvin, gamlatah-a konin agaldot din adingun; amani Jordan panga adinglhone.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chuin Elijah'in aponsil chu alan, ajel tumin, twi chu avon ahile hilam le khulama akikhenin, hitichun amani tolgoa chun ache galkai lhontai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chuin ahitin ahi, amani agalkailhon phatnin, Elijah'in Elisha jah-a, nangma-a kona lahmanga kaum masanghin, nangma ipi kabolpeh dingham, kithumin, ati. Chuin Elisha'n, katao ahi, nalhagao chan channi kachunga umhen, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chuin aman, nangman thil hahsatah nathum ahi; hijeng jongle nangma-a kona lahdoh-a kaum pet namu-a ahile, nachunga chutichun umhen; namu loule vang, chutilou ding ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chuin amani lamjot puma akihoulimpeh lhona ahile, veuvin, mei kangtalai khatle mei sakol ho ahungkilah-in, amani achom khenin; Elijah chu chimpeijin van'a akaltoutai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chule Elisha'n hichu amun, hepa, hepa, Israel kangtalai le asakol touthemho khu, tin asamin ahi. Chuin aman amachu amukit tapoi: chuin aponsil chu alan abotkeh-in, halni ason ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aman Elijah ponsil ama-a kona hunglha jong chu alan, akile kitnin, Jordan pama adingtai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aman Elijah ponsil ama-a kona hunglha chu alan, twi chu avon, Elijah Pakai Pathen chu hoija uma ham? ati, chuin amanjong twi avoh phatnin, hilam le khulama akikhenin ahi: chuin Elisha agalkaitai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chuin themgaoho chapate Jericho'a anagaldot jinga umhon ama amuphat uvin, amahon Elijah lhagao Elisha chunga achutai atiuve. Chuin ama kimupi dingin ahungun, amasanga tolla aboh khupmun ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chuin amahon ajah-a, tuhin vetemin, nasohte pasal hatcheh mi somnga kaumui; kataovu ahi, amaho cheohen lang na pupa gaholuhen; ijemtia Pakai lhagaovin apohtouva, molchung dung, ahiloule phaicham dunga ama aselhah hithei ahi, atiuve. Ahin aman nasol loudiu ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chuin amahon jachat umkhop leuva angeh phatnu chun, ajah uva, soltaovin, ati. Hijeh chun amahon pasal somnga asolun, nithum sung aholun, ahinla amupouve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chuin amaho ahenga ahungkit phatnun, (ajehchu Jericho'a uma ahi,) aman ajah uvah, chehih-un tia naheng uva kasei hilouham? ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chuin khopi sunga miho chun Elisha jah-a, vetemin, katao ahi, ka Pakaiyin namu banghin, hiche khopihi nomtah ahi; ahinla twi aphapon, aleiset jong gamtem ahi, atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chuin aman, kahenga leibel thahkhat hinchoi junlang, asunga chi hinkoijun, ati. Chuin hichu ahenga ahinchoijun ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chuin ama twisam phunga chun aga chen, asunga chun chi asung lutnin, Pakaiyin hitin aseije, Keiman hiche twihi kasuhtheng ahitai; tua patna thina, ahiloule gamtem umtalou ding ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hitichun Elisha'n asei dungjuijin, twi chu tuchan geijin aphajingtai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chuin ama hiche mun'a konchun Bethel lama achetou tan ahi, chuin lamdunga achetou petchun, khopi-a konin chapang neochaho ahungdoh-un, amachu eltolnan abolun ajah-a, lutolpa, chetouvin; lutolpa, chetouvin, atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chuin ama akinung heijin, amaho chu aven, Pakai minin agaosap tan ahi. Chuin vompi ni gammanga konin ahungdoh-in, chapang somlileni chu abottel lhontan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chuin ama chua konin Carmel molsanga achen, chu-a konchun Samaria lama akiletai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tun Judah leng Jehoshaphat lengchan kal kum somle kumget lhinkumin, Ahab chapa Jehoram chu Samaria'a Israelte chunga alengchang panin; chule kum somle kumni aleng changin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aman Pakai mitmun thilse abolin, apale anu bang vang ahipoi. Ajehchu apan anasem Baal milim chu anapai mangin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hijeng jongle ama Israel chonsetsah Nebat chapa Jeroboam chonsetna a chun abeh jingin; hia konchun akikangse pon ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chuin Moab lengpa Mesha chu kelngoi vahmi ahin, aman Israel lengpa henga kelngoinou sangjakhat le kelngoichal sangjakhat amul pumin anapen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahinla ahitin ahi, Ahab athi phatnin, Israel lengpa dounan Moab lengpa akiphin tan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chuin Jehoram lengpa chuphat laitah chun Samaria'a konin apotdoh-in, Israelte jouse chu asimtan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chuin ama achen Judah leng Jehoshaphat henga mi asolin, Moab lengpan keima dounan akiphin tai; Moab douna galsat dinga keima toh nalhon dingham? agati sah-e. Chuin aman, ka chetou ding ahi: keima nang tobang kahin, kamite namite tobang ahin, kasakolho nangma sakol ho tobang ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chuin aman lampi hoichepena ikitoltou diuham? ati. Aman adonbutnin, Edom gamthip jotpaina lamlena, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hitichun Israel lengpa chu Judah lengpa le Edom lengpa toh akontaove. Chuin nisagi achekolun ahile, anung juihou janel hole ganchaho donding twi aumtapon ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chuin Israel lengpan, ohe! Pakaiyin leng thumho hi Moab mite khutna pehdoh dinga eikou khomu hitante, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahinla Jehoshaphat'in, hikoma hi ama-a kona Pakai idopthei nadiu Pakai themgao khatbeh umlou ham? ati. Chuin Israel lengpa soh khatnin adonbutnin, Elijah khut twi sung jipa Shaphat chapa Elisha aume, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chuin Jehoshaphat'in, Pakai thu chu ama henga uma ahi, ati. Hitichun Israel lengpa le Jehoshaphat, chule Edom lengpa chu ahenga achesuh-un ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chuin Elisha'n Israel lengpa henga, keiman nangma toh ipi kiguijopna kaneijem? napa themgaoho le nanu themgaoho henga chen, ati. Chuin Israel lengpan ajah-a, chepong-e: ajehchu Pakaiyin hiche leng thumho hi Moab mite khutna pehdoh dinga akoukhom ahitai, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chuin Elisha'n, a-anga kadin jing hingjing janelho Pakai min panna kasei ahi, Judah leng Jehoshaphat hungjao hi kakhohsahlou hile, nangma lamhi vetjong kavet louding, mujong kakimusah louding nahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hijongle tumging tumthem mikhat neihin puipeh-un ati. Chuin ahitin ahi, tumging tumthem chun ahintum phatnin, Pakai khut achunga achutan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chuin aman, Pakaiyin hitin aseije, hiche phaicham hi kotongin dimsah-un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ajehchu Pakaiyin hitin aseije, nanghon hui himhim namu loudiu, go himhim jong namuloudiu ahi. Hijeng jongle hiche phaicham chu nadon diuva twi dimding, nanghole nagancha teo, chule nagamsa houvin adondingu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chule hichehi Pakai mitmu-a thil neocha bou ahi: aman Moab mite jong nakhut nuva apehdoh nahlai ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khopi kul nei jouse le khopi deilhen jouse najo uva, thingphung phaho jouse naphuh lhuh diu, twikul jouse nasuh kangdiu, chule gamphaho jouse songa nasuhset dingu ahi, ati, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chuin jingkah anneh thilto tophat vellin ahitin ahi, hichun veuvin, Edom lampia konin twi ahung longin, gamsung chu twijin adimsoh tai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chule Moab mite jousen, amaho satdingin lengho chu ahung kontou taove ti ajah phatnun, galvon kivon theija pat chunglam jouse akikhomun, gamgi china ading taove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chuin amaho jingkah matah-in athoudoh-un, twi chung chu nisan ahinkhon ahile, Moab miten apang langkhatna twi chu thisan bangin asanin amuvin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chuin amahon, hichehi thisan ahi; lengho chu akithat mong mong ahiuve, amaho khatle khat kithat to ahitaove; hijeh chun tun, Moab mite, gachom taote atiuvin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chuin amaho Israelte gebuh ahunglhun phatnun, Israelte akipat doh-un, Moab miho chu athat taovin, hitichun amaho amasanguva ajamtaove. Ahinla amahon amano peh-un, Moab mite chu agamsungu geisanin athatpeh jengun ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chule khopiho chu avochimun, agampha lai jouse amitakipmin song asekhumun avuhdimun, twikul jouse asubingun, thingphung phajouse aphuh lhuvin; Kirharaseth kho-a songho bouchu adalhaovin ahi. Ahinla ahsongse choiho acheleuvin, aga sumangun ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chuin Moab lengpan gal kisat chu ama dingin ahoise behsetne ti amuphatnin, chemjam themcheh mi jasagi akipuijin, Edom lengpa pan nalam suhkeh ding agongin; ahinla ajou joupouve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chujouvin akhela lengchang dingpa achapa lenpen chu amanin, kulvuma chun govam thilto dingin atohdoh-in; Israelte chunga hatah-in alunghangun ahi. Chuin ama chu adalhaovin, agamuva akile taove.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tun themgaoho chapate jite khatnin Elisha jah-a, nasohpa kajipa chu athitan; chule nasohpan Pakai aginje chu nahenai. Chule kachapa teni soh-a kaidingin kaleibat pao ahunge, tin akaptan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chuin Elisha'n amanu jah-a, ipi kabolpeh dingham? neisei peh-in, na in'a ipi naneijem? ati. Chuin amanun ajah-a, nasohnun ina thao belkhat tailou imacha kaneipoi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chuphatnin aman, naheng nakom jouse umle belho, akeoho ngeichu apadin galan, lhomcha gala hih beh-in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chule nahunglut tengle, nangma le nachateni kot nakikha khumdiu; bel jouse nasun dimuva, chule adimho jouse achoma nakoi diu ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hitichun amanu ahenga konchun achedoh-in, bel hinchoi peh-a achapa teni toh kot akikhakhumun; aman asung sung jengtan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chuin ahitin ahi, belho adimsoh phatnin, amanun achapa jah-a, bel neihin choipeh nalaijin, ati. Chuin aman anu jah-a, beldang aumtapoi, ati. Chuin thao chu akangtai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chuphatnin amanu ahungin Pathen mipa chu aseipehtai. Chuin aman, chen thao chu gakijoh inlang nabat gasan, chule amoh-a chun nangle nachapate kihinso taovin, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chuin nikhat hi numei haotah khat chenna Shunem kho-a Elisha agachen, amanun an nedin asolin ahi. Chuin ahitin ahi, aman hiche mun ahin hopa chanin, hia chun an nedin alutjin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chuin amanun a-inneipu jah-a, tun vetemin, eihin hopa jinguva hi Pathen mitheng khat ahi kahetai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Katao ahi, bang chunga khun indan neokhat sempeh hitin; ama dingin jalkhun khat, dokhang khat, touna khat, chule meivah khom koipeh hite; chutia chu ama eini koma ahungji teng, hia chu lutji ding ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chuin nikhat chu ahitin ahi, ama hilama chun ahungin, indan sunga chun alutnin, hia chun alumtai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chuin aman asohpa Gehazi henga Shunem, numeinu gakouvin, ati. Chuin aman agakouvin, amanu amasanga adingtai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chuin aman amapa jah-a, tun amanu jah-a, vetan, nangman keiho-a dingin najo chanin neikhoh sah-un; nangma ipi kabolpeh ding nahim? lengpa, ahiloule janel gallamkai henga thu kaseipeh diuham? tin dongin ati. Chuin amanun adonbutnin, keima kamite lah-a cheng kahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chuin aman, achutile amanu dinga ipi kibolpeh tantem? ati. Chuin Gehazi'n adonbutnin, tahbeh-in amanu chabei ahin, chule ajipahi tehse ahitai, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chuin aman, amanu chu kouvin, ati. Chuin amanu akouphatnin, amanu kotna adingtai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chuin aman, khovei tulai phatteng chapa khat napom ding ahi, ati. Chuin amanun, ahipoi, ka pakai, Pathen mipa, nasohnu henga jousei hih-in, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chuin phatche dungjuijin numei chu agaijin, Elisha'n ajah-a anasei phattah chun chapa khat ahingtan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chuin chapang chu akhandoh phatnin, nikhat hi chang at-ho lah-a apa henga agachen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chuin aman apa henga, kalu, kalu atin ahi. Chuin apan chapang khat henga, anu hengah puiloijin, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chuin aman chapangpa chu apoma, anu henga apui phatnin, anu khupchunga sun geijin atouvin, chujouvin athitai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chuin amanu achetouvin, Pathen mipa jalkhun chunga alupsah-in, kot akha khumin, achedohtai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chuin aman a-inneipu akouvin, nahenga katao ahi, Pathen mipa henga kalhaija kahungkit theinadin, gollhangho lah-a khatle sangan holah-a khat neihin solpeh in, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chuin aman, lhathahni ahiloule cholngahni jongla ahipon, ibola tunitah-a ahenga nache ding ham? ati. Ahin amanun, hung phapha nante, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chuin amanu sangan chunga atouvin, asohpa jah-a, masang lama tilloi loijin; thu kapeh tilouvin keima-a dingin olchesah hih-in, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hitichun achen Pathen mipa heng Carmel mollama ahungin ahi. Chuin ahitin ahi, Pathen mipan amanu gamlatah-a amuphatnin, asohpa Gehazi jah-a, vetemin, gallanga khu Shunem numeinu ahi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tun amanu kimupi din lhai jel-in, kangeh nahi, chule ajah-a, ima jouse phapha-a hinam? na inneipu phapha-a hinam? naocha chu phapha-a hinam? gatin, ati. Chuin amanun, apha phanai tin adonbutne.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chuin amanu lhanga Pathen mipa heng ahung lhun phatnin, akeng atuh jengin ahile; amanu sondohdin Gehazi'n ahin naijin ahi. Chuin Pathen mipan, limsah hih in; ajehchu amanu lung gentheija ahi: Pakaiyin keija kona a-ima, eihetsahlou ahitai, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chuphatnin amanun, ka pakai pa-a kona chapa kangeh-em? neijoulhep hih-in tia kanasei hilou ham? ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hitichun Gehazi jah-a, nakong kigah in, chule nakhutna katengol choijin lang chen; mikhat tou namujongle chun chibai boh hih-in, chule khat touvin na chibai jongle chun donhih-in; ka tenggol hi chapang maija gajamin, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Chuin chapangpa nuchun, Pakai hinna le nangma hinna pana kasei ahi, keiman nangma kadalhah louhel ding nahi, ati. Chuin akipatdoh-in, amanu chu ajuitai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chule Gehazi chu amani masanga anachen, tenggol chu naocha maija anajamtai; ahinla husale imacha jahding aumtapoi. Hijeh chun ama kimupi din achekitnin, ajah-a, chapang chu athoudoh dehpoi, tin aseipeh-in ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Chuin Elisha insung ahunglhun phatnin, veuvin, chapang chu athisan ajalkhuna analumin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hitichun alutnin, amani changseh insunga kot akikhakhum honin, Pakai henga ataotai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Chuin lupna-a chun akaldoh-in, chapang chunga chun aboh-in, akamle akam, amitle amit, chule akhutle akhut asuton ahi. Chuin chapang chu a-op khumin ahile chapangpa tichu ahunglum jepjep tan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Chuin akumlha kitnin, insunga chun avahlelen; chuin akaltou kitnin, ama chu a-opkhum kitnin ahi. Chuin chapang chu sagi veijen achin, chuin chapang chu amit ahahtai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Chuin aman Gehazi akouvin, Shunem numeinu hinkouvin, ati. Hitichun aman amanu ahinkoutan ahi. Chuin amanu ahenga ahung phatnin, nachapa hi kipomtan, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Chuin amanu alutnin, akengbula alhun, tolla aboh khupmin, achapa chu akipomin, apotdohtai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Chuin Elisha Gilgal'a ahungkit tai: chule gamsunga chun kel alhan; themgaoho chapate chu amasanga atouvun ahi. Chuin aman asohpa jah-a, bel lenchu songin lang themgaoho chapate din annoi honpeh in, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Chuin mikhat anche louva loujaova achen ahile gam lengpi guikhat amun, agachu a-ang dimset-in ahinpomin, annoi bela chun alhahtai: ajehchu amahon hihochu ipi ahi ahet louvu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Hitichun mipi ho nehdin athuhpeh taove. Chuin ahitin ahi, annoi chu aneh petnun, amahon ahin samdoh-un, vo Pathen mipa, belsunga thina aume atiuve. Hitichun amahon hichu anethei tapouve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ahinla aman, achutile anchu hinlaovin, ati. Chuin bela alhei lutnin; ajah uva, mihon anehtheina diuvin thuh-un, ati. Chuin belsunga chun imacha aphamo aumtapon ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Chuin Baal-shalisha'a konin mikhat ahungin, Pathen mipi chu ga masa-a kona kisem changlhah, sakol changlhah somni toh chang ga thah lihleh vuikhat ahinpohpeh in ahi. Chuin aman ajah-a, amahon aneh theina diuvin mipi ho chu pen ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Chuin asohpan, mi jakhatjen anga hichehi kaluipeh dingham? ati. Aman mihon aneh theina diuvin pen, tin aseikitnin ahi: ajehchu Pakaiyin hitin aseije, amahon neuvintin, anehval nahlaidiu ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Hitichun a-anguva aluipeh-in, amahon aneuvin, Pakai thu dungjui chun, aneh valu akhen nalaijun ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tun Syria lengpa janel lamkai Naaman chu a-pakaipa mitmu-a dinga milentah le jabol changtah ahin, ajehchu ama jala Pakaiyin Syria te chu galjona anapeh ji ahi. Ama hi mihat hangsantah jong ahin; hinla miphah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Syria mite chu ahon honin akitoldoh uvin, chule Israel gama konin numei chapang khat sohchangin ahin puidoh uvin; amanu chu Naaman inneipi jenin apangin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chuin amanu chun a-pakainu jah-a, ka pakaipa hi Samaria'a um themgaopa gakivetsah hitavele! ajehchu aman aphahhi athensah ding ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chuin Naaman agalutnin a-pakaipa jah-a chun, Israel gama kon nungahnu khun hiti tihin thu aseije agatin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chuin Syria lengpan, gache jengin, keiman Israel lengpa henga chun lekha khat jih nange, ati. Chuin ama akipatdoh-in, dangka talent som toh, sana nong sang gup toh, kikhelna von som akipoh-in ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chuin aman lekha chu Israel lengpa henga ahin choijin, athuchu hitin akisune: Tun hiche lekha hi nahenga ahunglhun teng, vetan, keiman kasohpa Naaman hi aphah-a kona nathensah theina dingin, nahenga kahinsolin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chuin ahitin ahi, Israel lengpan lekha chu asimphatnin, apon asat telin, keihi Pathen kahia, mi kathisah-a, kahin sahthei hija, hichepa hin phah thensah dinga kahenga mi ahinsol ham? hijeh chun ngaitouvin, katao ahi, chule veuvin keimatoh kinahna nading iti ahol hitam, atin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chule Pathen mipa Elisha'n Israel lengpan aponho abot tele ti ajah phatnin, lengpa henga mi asolin, ibola napon nabotel ham? Israel gama themgao khat aume ti ahetnadin, tun amachu kahenga hinsolin, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hitichun Naaman chu asakole akangtalai toh ahung kitolin, Elisha in kotphunga adingtai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chuin Elisha'n thupole khat ahenga asolin, Jordan'a sagivei gaki soplhan, chutile natahsa hungkile kitnin tin, chutengle natheng ding ahitai, agatisah-e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahinla Naaman alunghangin, ache mangin, hitin aseije, vetan, kei ngaiton ama kahenga hungdoh teijintin, dingintin, a-Pakai Pathen min kou intin, akhutna kanatna chung chu thamintin, chuteng phahna chu daminte kati ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Damascus vapiho, Abana le Pharpar khu Israel gama twi jouse sanga phajo hilou ham? hicheho-a khu kakisop lhah-a kathen moham? ati. Hitichun lunghang tah-in akiheijin achemang tai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chuin asohten ahin naijun, ahenga thu aseijun, hepa, themgaopan thil lentah boldia nasoleh, hichu nabolda theiding ham? Aman gakisoplhan lang thengtan, ati kalvalla ipiba asei nahlai dingham? atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chuphatnin ama achesuh-in, Pathen mipa sei dungjuijin, Jordan'a chun sagivei akiphumin ahi. Chuin avouchu chapangsen vou bangin ahungkile kitnin, athengseltan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chuin ama le aloiho jouse Pathen mipa henga ahungkile kitnun, amasanga ading taove. Chuin aman, vetan, leiset pumpi-a hin Pathen aumpon, Israel gama bou aumme ti tun kahetai; hijeh chun tun kangeh nahi, nasoh phatthei bohnahi neisan peh-in, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahinla aman, a-anga kadinjing Pakai hingjing mina kasei ahi, keiman imacha laponge, ati. Ahin alahteina dingin aman angeh-in, ahinla ama anompoi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chuin Naaman'in nahenga, chuti ahile, katao ahi, nasoh hi sangan nin apoh khopset leiset neipeh thei dingham? ajehchu nasoh hin tua pat Pakai henga tilouva, govam thilto le ganlhaina himhim pathen dangho henga kalha louhel ding ahitai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hiche thila hin Pakaiyin nasohhi ngaidam maihen; kapupa Rimmon houin'a chibaiboh dinga alut tengle, aman kakhut chunga akingaijin, chule keimatah hi Rimmon houin'a kunjia kahi. Keima Rimmon houin sunga kakunji teng nasohhi Pakai chun hiche thilahin eingai damhen, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chuin aman ajah-a lung mongin chetan, ati. Hitichun ama-a konin apotdoh-in achesaohih laije.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahinla Pathen mi Elisha sohpa Gehazi chun, ven kapun Syria mi Naaman thil hinkenho lahpeh louvin alhadoh jengtan; ahinla Pakai hinna pana kasei ahi, nungdel ingting ipiham khatbeh galahpeh inge, atin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hitichun Gehazi'n Naaman anungdeltai. Chuin Naaman'in anunga min ahindel amuphatnin, akimupidin kangtalai ja konin akumlhan, ijakai phapha-a hinam, anati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chuin aman, ijakai aphanai; kapun vetan tutah chun Ephraim mola konin themgao chapate mini ahung lhonin ahi. Kangeh nahi, dangka talent khat le kikhelna pon ni amani chu pen tia eihinsol ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chuin Naaman'in, lunglhai selin talent ni kilah jengin, ati. Chule akilah dingin hangeh-in angeh-in, sakhao ni sunga dangka talent nile kikhelna ponsil ni dipsunga athunin, asohte mini apohsah-in; chule Gahazi masanga chun ache lhonin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chuin insang alhun phatnun, amani khutna konin alan, insunga chun akoitai. Chuin amani chu alesolin, amani achedoh lhontai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahinla ama alutnin, apu anga adingtai. Chuin Elisha'n ajah-a, Gehazi hoilama kona hung nahim? ati. Chuin aman nasoh hoimacha kachepoi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chuin aman ajah-a aseijin, nakimupi dingpa akangtalaija kona ahung kiheikitna chu, kalungthim hi nangma toh kilhona hilou ham? sum, ponsil, Olive hon, lengpi hon, bongchal ho, soh pasal ho, chule soh numei ho lah phat ham?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hijeh chun Naaman phahna chu nangma chungle nachih lhahte chunga a-itih-a chujingding ahitai, ati. Chuin amasanga kona apotdoh doh-in buhbang bangin aphahtan ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chuin themgaoho chapaten Elisha jah-a, vetemin, tuhin nangma toh ichen khomnao munhi eiho dingin aneo behsehtai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kataovu ahi, Jordan lama cheohitin, mitinin thingtum khatcheh chua konchun laohitin, chumuna chun ichen nadiu mun kisemu hite, atiuve. Chuin aman, cheovin, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chuin mikhatnin, katao ahi, nasohte neilhon piuvin, ati. Chuin aman, lhonpi naovinge, tin adonbutnin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hitichun amahotoh alhontai. Chuin Jordan alhun phatnun, thing aphuhtaove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahinla mikhatnin thingtum atana ahile heichang chu twija alhalut tai. Chuin ama apengjah-in, ohe, hepu! mi-a kapalah ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chuin Pathen mipan hoija lhamang ham? ati. Chuin amun chu ahilin ahi. Aman molkang khat asatnin, amuntah-a chu akholutnin ahile; heichang chu ahung kiletdoh tai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hichun aman, kilah-in, ati, chuin aman akhut alhangin, akilahtai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chuin Syria lengpan Israelte chunga gal abolin, asohte toh thumop anei khomun, hiche mun chuche munchu kagebuh hiding ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chuin Pathen mipan Israel lengpa henga mi asolin, chuche mun jotlounadin chingtheijin; ajehchu hilama chun Syria te ahungsuh uve agatisah-e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chuin Israel lengpan Pathen mipa hilnale gihna mun'a chun mi asolin, hia konchun khatvei niveiseh hilouvin, akihuhhing jingin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hijeh chun Syria lengpa chu hiche thil jeh hin alungkham lheh-in, asohte akouvin, ajah uva, ilah uva Israel lengpa lama pang koipen ihiu nei musah loudiu ham? ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chuin asohte lah-a khatnin, vo lengpa ka pakai, khatcha aumpoi: Israel gamsunga Elisha themgaopan najalkhun danna nathuseiho chu Israel lengpa ahilji ahibouve, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chuin aman, keiman mi kasola kamat theinadin, chenlang hoija aum gavelhi temin, ati. Chuin ajah-a, vetan, Dothan'a aume, tin aseipeh-un ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hijeh chun hilama chun sakol ho, kangtalai ho, chule mipi janle asolin; amaho jan-in ahungun, khopi chu a-um kimvel taove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chuin Pathen mipa sohpa chu matah-a athodoh-a apotdohle, veuvin, mipi janelin khopi chu sakol ho le kangtalai toh anaum kimvelun ahi. Chuin sohpan ajah-a, ohe hepu! i-itiding hitam? ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chuin aman adonbutnin, kicha hih-in; ajehchu eini lama pangho chu amaho lama pangho sangin atamjouvin ahi, tin adonbutne.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chuin Elisha ataovin, Pakai, katao ahi, amuthei nadin amit hasah-in, ati. Chuin Pakaiyin gollhangpa mit ahasah-in ahile, aman amutan: chuin veuvin, Elisha kimvela molsang chu sakolle mei kangtalai ho adimsetnin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chuin amaho ahenga ahungsuh phatnun, Elisha Pakai henga ataovin, katao ahi, hiche mitehi amitnu chotsah-in, ati. Chuin Elisha thu dungjuijin amitnu achotsahtai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chuin Elisha'n ajah uva, hichehi lampichu ahipon, chule khopi jongchu hichehi ahipoi; neijuijun, chutile naholpao henga chu kapuiding nahiuve, ati. Ahinla aman amaho Samaria lama apuitai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chuin ahitin ahi, amaho Samaria ahunglhun phatnun, Elisha'n, Pakai amutheina diuvin, hiteho mit hi hasahtan, ati. Chuin Pakaiyin amitnu ahasahtan ahile, kho amutaovin; chule veuvin, amaho Samaria lailunga um anahi taove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chuin Israel lengpan amaho amu phatnin, Elisha henga, hepa amahohi katha dingham? katha dingham? ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aman adonbutnin, nangman amahohi nasuhmang louding ahi; nangman soh changa namat ho chu nachemjam le nathalpi-a natha dingham? Amahon aneh uva adonuva, chule apupao henga ache theina diuvin, amasanguva an le twi luipeh-in, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chuin amaho nehding nasatah-in agonpeh-in; chule amahon aneh uva, adon jouvun, amaho chu asolmang tan, amaho a-pakaipa henga achetauve. Hitichun Syria miho chu Israel gamsunga ahungkit tapouve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chuin hiche jouhin ahitin ahi, Syria lengpa Benhadad'in janel honpi chu akhomin, akontouvin, Samaria aumkol tan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chuin Samaria gama chun kel nasatah alhatan; chule veuvin, sangan lu khat dangka somgetna akijoh-a, vakhu eh hop li-a hop khat dangka nongsi nga-a akijoh kahsen, khopi chu aumchah jengun ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chuin Israel lengpa kulvuma ahung valea ahile, numei khatnin ama chu ahinsamin, ajah-a, neikithopin, ka pakai, vo lengpa, atin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chuin aman, Pakaiyin nakithopi loule keiman hoija kona kakithopi dingham? Chang pholla konin em, ahiloule lengpi kichilna-a konin em? ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chuin lengpan amanu jah-a, iti nahi ham? ati. Chuin amanun adonbutnin, hichenu hin kahenga, nachapa hintoh doh-in, tunin nehitin, chule jingle kei chapa nena hite, atin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hitichun kachapa kakihon lhonin, kane lhontai. Chuin ajing nikhon amanu henga, nachapa hintoh dohtan, neta hite, katin ahile; amanun achapa anaseltai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Chuin ahitin ahi, lengpan numeinu thusei ajah phatnin, apon asat telin; chuin palvuma vahlen, mipi chun aveovin, chule veuvin, atichunga khaodip pon akisiltan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chuin aman, tunikho-a hi Shaphat chapa Elisha luchang achunga aum den poupouva ahile, Pathen'in chutobang chun eibol hen, chule akalvalin jong eibol hen, atin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ahinla Elisha a-in'a atouvin, chule upahon atoupiuvin ahi. Chuin lengpan a-angsunga konin mikhat asolin; ahinla amapa chu ahunglhun masangin, aman upaho jah-a, hiche tolthatpa chapan kalu ladinga mi ahinsol hi nahet uvem? Veuvin, sottolpa ahungteng kot khah unlang, kotna lutsah hih helun: anunga khu apu kholhah gin hilouham? ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Chuin ama amahotoh akihou nalaijin, veuvin, thupo chu amaheng ahung lhungtai. Chuin aman, veuvin, hiche thilsehi Pakaiya kon ahin; Pakai chu ipi dinga kanga nahlai dingham? ati.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chujouvin Elisha'n, Pakai thuhi ngaijun; Pakaiyin hitin aseije, jingle tuphat teng Samaria kotpi phunga changbong nelsel tena dan khat sekel khat, chule sakol chang tena dan ni sekel khatna kijoh ding ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chuin lengpa kingaina milen khatnin Pathen mipa chu adonbutnin, veuvin, Pakaiyin van'a bangkot ahonding hijongle, hichu hitheidi hinam? ati. Chuin aman, vetan hichehi namitna namu-a, neh vang naneh louding ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chuin kotpisung lutna-a chun miphah li aumin; amaho khatnin khat jah-a, hikomahi ibola ithi kahseuva itou diuham?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khosunga lutnu hite tileu henla, khosung kel alhan, chua chu ithi jeng dingu ahin; hilaija hin hiti tou jongleu hen, ithi thou thoudiu ahi. Hijeh chun tun hungtemun, Syria sepaiho lama kipelut jengu hite; eihing hoijule hingu hitin; eithaolela ithi maidingu hitante, akitiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Syria miteho gebuh-a chedingin khomut chipchep in akipatdoh taovin; chuin amaho Syria te gebuhpam nungpen ahung lhunule, veuvin, hichea chun koimacha anaum tapoi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ajehchu Pakaiyin Syria mite janel chu kangtalai ho husagin, sakol ho hugin, janelho hugin chule janel tamtah ho hugin geijin ajahsah-in; chuin khatnin khat jah-a aseijun, veuvin, Israel lengpa hin Hit lengte, Egypt lengte hohi ichunguva galbol dinga apalah ahi, atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hijeh chun amaho akipatnun khomut chipchep in ajamun, apon inhou, asakolhou, asanganhou, chule agebuh-u chu atobang bangin ahinna diuvin adalhaovin, ajamtaovin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chuin hiche mi phahho chu gebuh manglhapen alhun phatnun, pon-in khatna agalutnun, aneuvin adonnun, chua konchun sana le dangka chule ponsil ho akilah uvin, acheuvin agaselun; chuin ahungkitnun gebuh chomdang khatna alut kitnun, chu-a kon jongchun alah kitnun, aselkitnun ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chuin amaho khatnin khat jah-a aseijun, ithilbolu hi aphapoi; tuni hi kipana thupha lhunni ahin, eiho ithipbeh jengun ahi: jingkah khovah gei ingauva ahile, ichunguva thilse hunglhung thei ahi. Hijeh chun tun hungun, icheuva lengte insung igahil theina diuvin, akitiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hitichun ahungun, khopi kotngahpa chu akouvun, ahenga, Syria miho gebuh-a kagacheuvin, chule vetan, chua chun mi koimacha aumpon, mi awjong akijapon, ahinla sakol ho, sanganho akihennin, pon inho chu abang bangin aume, atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chuin aman kotngah ho chu akouvin, chuin amahon leng insunga miho chu ahilun ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chuin lengpa chu ajanin athouvin, asohte henga, tun keiman Syria miten ichunguva ipi abolem navetsah uvinge, eiho igilkel uve tihi ahetnuva; hijeh-a chu agebuh uva kona chu gamlah-a kiseldinga potdoh uva, amaho khopi-a kona ahungdoh tengule ahingin man-u hitin, khopi sunga lutnu hite atiu ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chuin asohte lah-a khatnin adonbutnin, nahenga katao ahi, khopi sunga sakol umsun lah-a ngahi mi phabep gakaisah-in, (vetan, amahohi akidalha Israel mipi ho jouse tobang ahiuvin; vetan, amaho Israel mipi athigam saho tobang ahiuve:) hijeh chun amaho solu hitin, vetem uhite kati-e, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hijeh chun amahon sakol kangtalai ni alauvin; chule lengpan Syria janelho nunga mi asolin, cheovinlang gaveovin, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chuin amaho Jordan lama amaho nunglama acheule; veuvin, lampi jouse chun Syria miten akino nalam uva apaiju um le bel chule ponsil adimsetnin ahi. Chuin thupo ho akileuvin lengpa ahiltaove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chuin mipi apotdoh-un, Syria mite ponbuh chu achom taove. Hitichun Pakai thu dungjuijin, changbong nel tena dim khat sekel khat manin akijoh-in, chule sakol chang tena ni chu sekel khat manin akijohtan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chuin lengpan kingaina milenpa chu kul kotpi ngah-in apansah-in ahi. Ahenga lengpa ahung kumsuh laija, Pathen mipan anasei bangin, amapa chu mipin kotphunga ana chotphaovin, athitai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chuin Pathen mipan lengpa henga anasei, jingle tuphat vela Samaria kotbula sakol chang tena dimni sekel khat manna kijoh-a, chule changbong nel tena dimkhat sekel khat manna kijoh ding ahi, atia;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chule pipui pan, vetan, Pakaiyin van'a bangkot ahonding hijongle, hichu hitheidi hinam? tia ana donbutna; Elisha'n, ven, nangman hiche chu namitna namu ding, nehvang naneh louding ahi, tia anasei ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hitobang chun ama chunga achutai. Ajehchu mipin kotpiphunga achotphaovin, ama athitan ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chuin Elisha'n achapa adamsah numei henga chun, kipatdoh-in, nangma le na-insung mite naumthei theina dinguvin, napem nathei chanun gapemun; ajehchu gamsunga Pakaiyin kumsagi jen kel alhahsah ding ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chuin Pathen mipan asei dungjuijin, numei chu akipat doh-in; a-insung mite toh acheuvin Philistine gama chun kumsagi agapemun ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chuin kumsagi kichai chun ahitin ahi, numeinu chu Philistine'a konin ahungkile kitnin, lengpa henga a-inle alou ngeh dingin agachen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chule lengpan Pathen mipa soh Gehazi ana kihoulim pin, katao ahi, Elisha thilbol loupiho jouse chu neihilin, atin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chuin ahitin ahi, mithisa khat ahinsahkit asei laitah chun, veuvin, achapa kihinsahkit numeinu chu lengpa henga a-in le lou ngehnan ahung taovin ahi. Chuin Gehazi'n, ka pakai, vo lengpa, hichehi Elisha'n ahinsah numeinu le achapa chu ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chuin lengpan numeinu chu adongin ahile, amanun aseipehtan ahi. Hitichun lengpan vaipo khat angansen, hiche numeinu-a jouse chu lepeh kitnin, chule gamsung adalhah nikho-a pat tuchan geija loujaova agaho jouse lepeh kit tan, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chuin Elisha Damascus'ah ahungin; chule Syria lengpa Benhadad chu anadampon; ahenga, Pathen mipa chu hilama ahunge, ti aseipeh-un ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chuin lengpan Hazael jah-a, thilpeh kenginlang Pathen mipa gakimupin, chule hiche kanatna-a kona hi kadamdoh kitding hinam? Pakai chu gadohsah temin, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hitichun ama kimupi din Hazael achen, thilpehdin Damascus'a konin thilpha tincheng sangongsao somli jen poh thil akengin, ahungin ama masanga adingin, nachapa Benhadad Syria lengpan nahenga eihinsolin, hiche natna-a kona hi kadamdoh kitding ham? atin ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chuin Elisha'n ajah-a, thonlouva nadamdoh kitding ahi gatipeh-in: ahinla thitei teiding ahi ti Pakaiyin eimusahtai, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chuin jachat umkhop leuvin amapa chu aven: chuin Pathen mipa chu akaptai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chuin Hazael'in, kapu chu ibola kapjeng nahim? ati. Aman, Israel chate chunga thilse naboldingchu kahetjeh ahi; akuldetho halhan natin, agollhangho chemjamin thatnin natin, achateu chule anu oipi sunga umho jongchu nakhejalpeh ding ahi, tin adonbutne.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chuin Hazael'in, nasoh keima hi uicha kahija, hitobang thil loupi chu katohthei ding hijaham? ati. Chuin Elisha'n, nangma Syria mite chunga leng nahiding Pakaiyin eimusah ahitai, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hitichun ama Elisha'a konin apotnin, apu henga ahungtai. Aman ajah-a, Elisha'n nahenga ipi aseijem? ati. Chuin aman na damdoh teiding ahi, ti eiseipeh-e, tin adonbutnin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chuin ajingin ahitin ahi, ponsatah khat alan twija adekotnin, amai akhunan ahile, hitichun athitan ahi. Chuin Hazael alengchang tai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chuin Israel leng Ahab chapa Jehoram lengchan kal kum ngana-in, Jehoshaphat chu Judah leng hija ahin, Judah lengpa Jehoshaphat chapa Jehoram chu ahung lengchang panin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama alengchan patchun kum somthumle kum ni ahin, Jerusalem'a kumget aleng changin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chule aman Ahab insung chonna bangin, Israel lengte lamlhah ajotnin ahi: ajehchu a-inneipi chu Ahab chanu hija ahin; Pakai mitmun thilse abolin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hijongle ama le achate henga meivah pehjing dinga ana thutep bangin, asoh David khohsahna jalchun Judah chu asumangpon ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama nikho laijin Edom chu Judah khutnoija konin akiphinun, achunguva lengkhat akisem taove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hijeh chun Joram kangtalai jousetoh Zair'a achetouvin ahi. Chuin ama jan-in athou doh-in, ama umkimvel Edom miho le gal lamkai kangtalai ho athatgamin; mipi ho chu aponbuh sunguva ajamlut gamtaove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahinla Edom Judah khutnoija konin tuni geijin akiphinun ahi. Chuin hiche phat mama chun Libna jong akiphinin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chule Joram thilbol dangho jousele atoh jouse chu Judah lengte thusimbua kisun hilouham?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chuin Joram apu apate toh alumkhomin, David khopi-a apu apate toh akivuitai. Chuin ama khelin achapa Ahaziah alengchang tai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Israel leng Ahab chapa Joram lengchan kal kum somle kumni na-in, Judah leng Jehoram chapa Ahaziah alengchang panne.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Alengchan pat kumchun Ahaziah kum somni le kumni ahitai. Chuin ama Jerusalem'a kumkhat aleng changin ahi, chule anu minchu Athaliah ahin, Israel lengpa Omri chanu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chuin aman Ahab insung lamlhah ajotnin, Pakai mitmun Ahab insung bol bangin thilse abolin ahi. Ajehchu ama Ahab insung tupa hija ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chuin ama Ramoth-gilead'ah Syria lengpa Hazael kisatpi dingin Ahab chapa Joram toh achen; chuin Syria miten Joram amavo taove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chuin Joram lengpa chu Syria lengpa Hazael to akisat petnuva Ramah mun'a akimavona kijen dinga Jezreel lama akinungle tan ahi. Chuin Judah lengpa Jehoram chapa Ahaziah chu, Jezreel'a um Ahab chapa Joram anat jeh-a vedin achesuh-in ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chuin Elisha themgaovin themgao chate khat akouvin, ajah-a, natai kigah-in, chule nakhutnin hiche thaobom hi choijin lang Ramoth-gilead'a gache-in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chukoma nagalhun teng, Nimshi chapa Jehoshaphat chapa Jehu chu holdoh inlang lutnin; chule asopite lah-a konin kipatdohsah inlang, indan sungnung khatna puilutnin:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chule thaobom chu lanlang aluchunga sungin, chule ajah-a, Pakaiyin Israelte chunga lengdinga thao kanu nahitai, atie, tin seijin. Chuteng kot honginlang jamin, chule khongai hih-in, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hitichun themgao gollhangpa chu Ramoth-gilead'a achetai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chuin ahung lhunle, veuvin, janel gal lamkaiho chu ana toukhomun ahi; chuin aman, gal lamkaipa, nahenga thukhoh seiding kaneije, ati. Chuin Jehu'n koipen henga am? ati. Chuin aman, vo gallamkai, nangma henga, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chuin ama akipatdoh-in, insunga alut tai; chuin aman aluchanga thaochu asungin, ajah-a, Israel Pakai Pathen'in hitin aseije, Pakai mipite Israelte chunga lengdinga thao kanu nahitai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kasohte themgaoho thisanle Pakai sohte jouse thisan phuchu Jezebel khutna kalah theina dinga, Ahab insung mite chu natha gamhel ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ajehchu Ahab insung pumpi mangthah ding; Israel gamsunga Ahab'a kona cha pasal tapou chu, ongthol hihen akihen hijongle kasuhmang ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chule Ahab insung chu Nebat chapa Jeroboam insung bangle, Ahijah chapa Baasha insung banga kasem ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Uicha hon Jezebel chu Jezreel kulpanga anehdiu, amanu vuiding koimacha umlou ding ahi, ati. Chuin kot ahongin ajamtai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hitichun Jehu chu apu sohte henga ahungdohtan; chuin mikhatnin ajah-a, ijakai phasohnam? ibola mi ngolpahi nahenga hunga ham? ati. Chuin aman ajah uvah, nahetsao mi hija, athusei jong nahetnu chula-em, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chuin amahon, kahe pouve; tun neihilun atiuve. Chuin aman ahenguva, hiti hitihin kahenga thu aseijin, Pakaiyin hitin aseije, Israelte chunga lengdinga thao kanu nahi, atie, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chuin amaho amitakipmin aponu asutlhaloi chelun, kalbiho chungnung pena ama noija chun aphaovin; sumkon amutnun, Jehu alengchang tai, atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hitichun Nimshi chapa Jehoshaphat chapa Jehu chun Joram dounan aguh-a thil agong pantan ahi. (Tun Joram, amale Israelte jousen, Syria lengpa Hazael jeh-a Ramoth-gilead chu ana ngatupmu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Joram lengpa vangchu Syria leng Hazael toh akisat laija Syria leng miten amavo chu Jezreel kho-a kisudam dinga kilekit ahitai.) Chuin Jehu'n, pha nasah ule koimacha Jezreel langa hiche thusei dingin potdohsah hih-un, ahiloule jam dohsah hihhelun, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hitichun Jehu chu kangtalai ja atouvin, Jezreel lama chun achetan ahi; ajehchu chukoma Joram uma ahin, chule Judah lengpa Ahaziah chu Joram vedinga hungsuh-a ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chuin Jezreel insung chunga chun khongah khat adingin, amachun Jehu loiho hungchu amulhin, mihon khat kamui, ati. Chuin Joram'in, amaho kimupi din sakol toumi solinlang, chamna thu hinam? gatisah-in, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hitichun mikhat akimupidin sakol chunga atouvin achen, lengpan chamna thu hinam? atie agati. Chuin Jehu'n chamna iding natiham? kanunglama chen, ati. Chuin khongahpa chun aseijin, thupolepa chu ahenguva achen, ahinla ahungkile tapoi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chuin aman aniveinan michom dang khat sakol chunga asolkitnin, ahenguva ahunglhunin, lengpan chamna thu hinam? atie ati. Chuin Jehu'n adonbutnin, chamna iding natiham, kanung lama chen, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chuin khongah pan, ama jong ahengu agalhungin, ahinla ahung kinungle kit tapoi: chule asakol tildan jong Nimshi chapa Jehu sakol tildan abange; ajehchu hamvevun atil jenge, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chuin Joram'in kigon, ati. Chuin akangtalai agotpeh taove. Chuin Israel leng Joram le Juda leng Ahaziah akangtalai gela atoulhonin, Jehu kimupi din akondoh lhonin, chule Jezreel mi Naboth honsunga akimuto pi lhontan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chuin ahitin ahi, Joram'in Jehu amu phatnin chamna thu hinam, Jehu? ati. Chuin aman adonbutnin, nanu Jezebel jonthanhoina le doithu hijatpi hi aumlai se-a ipi chamna umthei dingham? atin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chuin Joram'in akhut aleheijin, ajam'in, chule Ahaziah jah-a, vo Ahaziah kiduha bolna aume, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chuin Jehu'n athanei chasunin thalpi chu aloijin, Joram dahteni kikahtah-a akapma ahile, athalmuh jumin aluchang adotpaijin, akangtalai chunga a-op dentai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chujouvin Jehu'n agal lamkaipa Bidkar jah-a, along chu lanlang, Jezreel mi Naboth loulai mun'a seplhatan; ajehchu hiche hi geldoh-in, nangle kei apa Ahab nunga itoukhom laija, Pakaiyin hiche pohgih hi achunga anangap ahitai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Pakaiyin, tahbeh-in janhin Naboth thisanle achapate thisan kamu mong mongin; chule hiche mun mama-a hi kalethuh ding nahi, tin Pakaiyin aseije. Hijeh chun tun Pakai thu dungjuijin ama chu lanlang, hiche leiset munahin seplhan, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ahin Judah lengpa Ahaziah chun hichu amuphatnin, hon inlampi lama ajamtan ahi. Chuin Jehu'n anung ajuijin, kangtalai ja chun amajong thatnun, ati. Chuin Ibleam khokenga Gur jot touna-a chun hitichun abol taovin ahi. Chuin ama Megiddo lama ajamin, hia chun athitai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chuin asohten Jerusalem lama kangtalai khatna apouvin, David khopi-a apu apate toh lhana avuitaove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chuin Ahab chapa Joram lengchan kal kum kumsomle kumkhat na-a chu Ahaziah chu Judah te chunga ana lengchang pan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Chuin Jezreel'a Jehu ahung phatnin, hichu Jezebel'in ajatan; amanun amai ajemin, asam akipo jolin, bangkotna konin ahinven ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chuin Jehu kotpi-a alut tolhonin, amanun, apu thatpa Zimri'in chamna anei hinam? atin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Chuin Jehu bangkotlam ngan adahdoh-in, koiham keima lama pang? koiham? atin ahi. Chuin nukiso ni ham thum hamin ahin veuvin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Chuin aman, amanu chu hinson lhaovin, ati. Chuin mahon ahin sonlhaovin ahile, athisan phabeppi bang le sakol ho chunga akithe thangin ahi. Chuin aman akengton anachilin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Chuin ama alut phatnin, anen adon tan ahi. Chuin aman, cheovin, hiche sapset changnuhi gaveovin lang gavuijuvin; ajehchu amanuhi leng chanu khat ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Chuin amaho avui dingin ache taove; ahinla amahon alugu le akeng chule akhut phangho tailou adang amu tapouve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Hitichun amaho ahung kile kitnun, hichu ahung hetsah taove. Chuin aman, hichehi Pakaiyin asoh Tishbi mi Elijah'a kona anasei, Jezreel khomuna Jezebel phe uichaten anehdiu;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Chule koimachan, hilaija hin Jezebel akivuije atilouna dinguva, alongchu Jezreel gam loujaova eh tobang hiding ahi, tia anasei guilhuna ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Samaria'a chun Ahab'in chapa Somsagi aneijin ahi. Chuin Jehu'n Samaria'a Jezreel vaipoho, chule Ahab chate hinvah dohho henga chun lekha athotnin, hitin asune;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tun hiche lekha hi nahengu ahunglhun lhunle, napupao chapate chu naheng uva uma, chule kangtalai ho, sakol ho, kulpi kium le galvon jong naneiju ahin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Napu-u chapate lah-a aphapen veovin lang, apa laltouna chunga tousah-un, chule napu insung dingin gal sat uvin, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahinla amaho akicha behset jengun, veuvin, amasanga leng nibon dingjou louva; eiho iti idinthei dinguham? atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chuin leng insunga vaipopa, khopi chunga vaipopa, upaho jong, chule chapangho hinvah dohho nasan chun Jehu henga chun thu athotnun, keiho nasohte kahiuvin, nangin bolin neiti jouseu bolung ting; leng khatcha sem pouvinge: namitmu-a pha nasah chan boljengin, atiuvin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chujouvin aniveina-in lekha hitin asun kitnin, keima-a nahiuva, kathu nangai dinguva ahile, napupao chapate luchu hinlaovin lang jingle tuphat hin Jezreel'a kahenga hunguvin, tin asunin ahi. Tun leng chapate chu somsagi ahiuvin, ahin vahdoh-a khopi milen hotoh umngen ahiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chuin ahitin ahi, lekha chu ahengu alhun phatnin, lengchapate chu amanun, asomsagi chun athatnun, alu chu boma akhumun, chule amahon hichu Jezreel'a athot taove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chuin thangkou khat ahungin, amahon lengpa chapate lu ahinpo taove, tin amachu aseipeh-e. Chuin aman khopi lutna akhun lhuhnin lhu khomun lang, jingkah geijin umhen, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chuin jingkah-in ama apotdoh-in, adingin, mijouse jah-a chun, nangho michonpha nahiuve: veuvin, kapu chu ka changlhin kathat tai. Ahinla hicheho jousehi koitha ham?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pakaiyin Ahab mite chungthu asei Pakai thuchu halkhat chajong tolla lhamang louding ahi ti tuhin hechennun: ajehchu Pakaiyin asoh Elijah kama aseichu atohdoh ahitai, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hitichun Jehu'n Jezreel'a Ahab insung mi amoh jouse, amilenho jouse, chule asangkaiho, athempuho khatcha khenlou hela atha chai kahsen athatnin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chuin ama akipatdoh-in achen, Samaria ahungtai. Chuin lamdunga kelngoimul vona in'a aumchun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jehu'n Judah lengpa Ahaziah sopiho amun, koi nahiuvem? ati. Chuin amahon keiho Ahaziah sopite kahiuvin; lengpa chate le lengnu chate chibai bohdinga chesuh kahiuve, tin adonbutnuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chuin aman ahingin man-un ati. Chuin amaho ahingin amanun, kelngoimul vona in kokhuh-a mi somlileni jen athatnun; amaho khatcha khen aneipoi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chuin chukom adalhah phatnin, Rechab chapa Jehonadab ama lamto-a hung amun: chuin chibai aboh-in, ajah-a, nachunga lungdih kaput banga hi lungdih naputnem, ati. Jehonadab'in kapu nai, ati. Achutile nakhut neihinpen, ati. Chuin akhut agahpen ahile, ama henga kangtalai chunga akai luttai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chuin aman kahenga hungin lang Pakai dinga katompanje hungven, ati. Hitichun akangtalai chunga atousah taove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chuin ama Samaria ahunglhun phatnin, Elijah henga Pakai thusei dungjuijin, Ahab insungmi Samaria umjouse chu asuhmanghel kahsen abonchan athat gamtan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chuin Jehu'n mijouse akoukhomin, ajah uvah, Ahab'in Baal chu anajen maimai ahin; Jehu'n vang aha jencheh ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hijeh chun tun Baal themgao jouse, asohte jouse, chule athempu jouseu kahenga hinkouvun; koima alhasam umlou helding ahi: ajehchu Baal henga ganlhaina loupitah kabolding ahin; aumlouchan chu kihinghoi louhel ding ahi, ati. Ahinla Jehu'in Baal houho thagam nadinga, doha thuhtah-a abol ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chuin Jehu'n Baal houna dingin khoppilen phongjalun, ati. Chuin amahon aphongjal letaovin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chuin Jehu'n Israel pumpi thu athotnin; Baal houjouse ahungun, hitichun ahunglou mikhatcha jong aumpoi. Chuin amaho Baal insunga alutnun; Baal kotbula konin bangtom changei adimset jengun ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hitichun kivonna pon hompa jah-a chun, Baal houho jousehi kivonna pon pecheh in, ati. Hitichun kivonna pon chu apecheh-in ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chuin Jehu le Rechab chapa Jehonadab chu Baal insunga chun alutlhonin, chuin Baal houho jah-a chun, holun lang veleuvin, hiche-a hin Baal houho tailou Pakai mite jong umgetnunte, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chuin ganlhaina le govam thilto tohdinga alutphatnun, Jehu'n polama mi somget adinsah-in, ajah uva, nakhut uva kahinpuilut mikhattou ahoidoh auma, ajamdohsah aumle, ajamdohpa hinna khela aman ahinna achanding ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chuin ahitin ahi, aman govam thilto achai chaijin, Jehu'n avetuphole gal lamkaiho jah-a, lutnun lang thatnun; khatcha hung dohsah hih-un, ati. Chuin amaho chu chemjamin athatnun; chuin ngahtuple gal lamkaiho chun ahinleh doh-un, khopi-a Baal in'a chun acheuvin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chuin Baal in'a konin milimho ahinpodoh-un, ahalvam taove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chuin Baal milim chu asuchimun, Baal in chu asulhuvin, tunigeijin ehbuh in aneijuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hitobang chun Jehu'n Israel lah-a konin Baal anasumang helin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ahijeng vangin Bethel le Dan'a um sana bongnou lim asema, Israel chonset sahpa, Nebat chapa Jeroboam chonset naho-a konin Jehu chu akiheimang dehpon ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Chuin Pakaiyin Jehu jah-a, kamitmu-a thildih nabola, kalungsunga umho jouse dungjuija Ahab insung chunga nabolphat jeh-a, nachate khang li geija Israelte laltouna-a toudiu ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ahinla Jehu'n alungthim pumpi-a Israel Pakai Pathen dan thupeh-a chon ding chu akhohsahpon ahi; ajehchu Israelte chonsetsah Jeroboam chonset na-a konin akihei mangpon ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hiche laichun Pakaiyin Israel gamsung chu asukeh pantan; Hazael'in Israel gamsung jouse ahinjou pehtan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Jordan'a pat solamsang, Gilead gam jouse, Gad te, Reuben te, Manasseh te, Arnon vapidung panga Aroer kho-a pat Gilead le Basan geijin ahinlatan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tun Jehu thilbol danghole anatoh jouse chu Israel lengte thusimbua kisunlut hilouham?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Chuin Jehu chu apu apate toh alumkhomin, amachu Samaria a avuitaove. Chuin achapa Jehoahaz ama khelin alengchang tan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Samaria'a Israelte chunga Jehu lengchan phatsung chu kum somni le kumget ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chuin Ahaziah nu Athaliah'in achapa athi amuphatnin, akipatnin leng chilhah jouse asumangtai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahinla Ahaziah sopinu, Joram lengpa chanu Jehosheba chun, Ahaziah chapa Joash chu leng chapate kithat ho lah-a konchun anagudoh-in; amale adon nutah chu Athaliah'a konin lupna indan sunga asel honin, hitichun amachu akithat tapoi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chule amanu chutoh Pakai in'a kumget akisel lhone. Chule Athaliah chu hiche gama chun leng achangtan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chuin kum sagina-a chun Jehoiada'in mi asolin, jakhat chunga vaihomho, gal lamkaiho le ngahtupho agakou sah-in, amaho chu Pakai insunga ama henga apuilutnin, amaho chu kitepna aneipin, Pakai insunga chun akihahsel sah-in, chule leng chapa chu amaho avetsah-in ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chuin amaho chu thu apen, hichehi nabol dingu thil chu ahi; nalah uva choldoni-a hunglut ho chu hopthum-a hopkhatnin leng in chu ngah untin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chule hopthum-a hopkhat Sur kotpi-a umding, hopthum-a hopkhat ngatupna nunglam kotpi phunga umding: hiti achu in chu achimlhah louna dinga nangatup diu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chule nangho choldoni-a potdoh ho jouse lah-a hopni chun, lengpa kimvela Pakai in chu angadiu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chule amitakipmin manchah akichoicheh-a, lengpa chu na-umkim veldiu ahi. Chule aki-um sunga hunglut lutchu nanatha diu, chule lengpa apotdoh le ahunglut nalhonpi jingdingu ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chuin Jehoiada thempu thupeh dungjuijin, jakhat chunga gallamkai hochun abolun; chule amahon choldoni-a hunglut ding amite cheh-u, chule choldoni-a potdoh dingho chu ahinpuijun, Jehoiada thempu henga ahungcheh-un ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chuin thempupan Pakai houin sunga um David lengpa tengcha ho le lumho chu sepai jakhat chunga gallamkai hochu apen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chuin ngahtupa le amitakipmin amanchah-u akhut cheh uva akichoijun lengpa akimvelun, houin ning jetlama pat houin ning veilam gei akigolun, houin le maicham lhon lhungin adingun ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chuin Jehoiada'in lengpa chapa chu ahinpui doh-in, Lallukhuh chu akhuhpeh-in, het tohsahna chu apen; chuin amahon amachu lengin atungun, thao anuvin; akhutnu abengun, Pathen'in lengpa huhhing hen atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chuin ngahtupho le mipi husa chu Athaliah'in ajah phatnin, Pakai in'a mipi ho lah-a chun ahunglut tan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amanun agahven ahileh, veuvin, chonna ngaibangin sutpi phunga lengpa chu anadingin, pipuiho le sumkon mut ho lengpa koma chun adingun, gamsunga mipite jouse akipah-un, sumkon amutnuvin ahi. Chuin Athaliah'in apon abot eh-in, kidouna, kidouna tin apeng jah-in ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahinla jakhat chunga lamkaiho le sepai janel milenho chu Jehoiada thempupan thu apen, ajah uvah, ngahtupho kikah lah-a konin potdoh sah-un, chule amanu juitapou chu chemjamin thatnun, ati. Ajehchu thempupan, amanu chu Pakai houin sunga that hih-un ati ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chuin amanu chunga khut alhaovin; amanu chu lengpa in'a sakol ho hunglutnaji lampia chun achen, chu-a chun amanu athat taove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amaho chu Pakai mite ahitheina diuvin, Jehoiada'n Pakai le lengpa chule mipi kah-a kitepna asemin, leng le mipi kah-a jong chutichun aseme.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chuin gamsung mijouse Baal insunga alutnun, asuchimun, maicham ho masanga chun Baal thempu Mattan chu athat taove. Chuin thempupan Pakai inpi chunga vaipo ding alhengin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chuin jakhat chunga lamkaiho gal lamkaiho, ngahtuppa, chule gamsung mipite jouse apuijin; amahohin lengpa chu Pakai in'a konin ahinpuisuh-un, leng in ngahho kotpi lampi ahin houvin ahi. Chuin ama lengho laltouna-a atoutai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chuin gamsung mipi jouse akipah-un, khopi chu athip chetnin; chule Athaliah chu lengpa inpanga chemjamin athatnun ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jehoash alengchan patchun kum sagibou ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jehu lengchankal kumsagi na-in Jehoash alenchang panin; chule ama Jerusalem'a kum somli alengchange. Chule anu minchu Zibiah ahin, Beersheba mi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chuin Jehoash chu Jehoiada thempun ahilchah bangin, ahinkho lhum keijin Pakai mitmu-a adihchu abol jingin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahivangin munsang ho chu akiladohpon; munsang ho-a chun mipi ho chun ganlhaina le gimnamtui halna aneijing nalaijun ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chuin Jehoash'in thempuho jah-a, Pakai insunga hinkipolutna akikat dohsa sum jouse, amitakipmin apeh dinga kitepeh dungjuija ato doh-u sum jouse, chule alungsunga Pakai insunga pohlutdinga akigelhah dungjuija atodoh sum jouse chu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thempuhon hicheho chu lakhomu hen, mitinin amel hethouva konin lalutnu hen; chule houin selaiho, aselai kimuchanse chu semphat nan neiju hen, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahinla ahitin ahi, Jehoash lengchan kum somni le kumthum lhinin thempuhon houin selaiho chu asempha pouvin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chuin leng Jehoash'in Jehoiada thempu le thempu dangho akouvin, ajah uvah, ibola houin selaiho chu nasemphat lou uham? hijeh chun tun namel hethouva konin sum latahih-un, ahinla houin selaiho sempha dingho pedoh jengun, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chuin thempuho chun miho-a kona sum lahtah loudingle amaho tah-in houin selaiho asemphat loudingu chu pha asaovin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahivangin thempu Jehoiada'n thingkhong khat alan, asin agei vangin, Pakai in lutna jetlama maicham panga akoijin ahi. Hichea chun Pakai ina sum kichoilut jouse chu kotngah thempuho chun akoilutji jiuvin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chuin ahitin ahi, thingkhonga chun sum atamtai ti ahet tenguleh, lengpa lekha sunpa le thempu chungnung chu hungji-a, dipho-a akoijiuva, Pakai insunga kimu sum hochu asimjiu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chutengle amaho asimsao sum chu natongho, Pakai insaho chunga vaipoho khutna apeh jiuva; amahon Pakai in bolna dinga natongho, thingthemho le insaho,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chule songbol ho, song khengho, chule Pakai in selaiho semphatna dinga thing le song kikhengsa ho chohna dingle, chule angaicha ho jouse-a dinga apehjiu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahijeng vangin Pakai insunga sum hungkichoilut chun Pakai in'a dingin dangka khonho, kong leh bel, twikongho, sumkon ho, sanabelho, dangka belho asemhih laijuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahinla natong miho henga apeuvin, hichu Pakai in semphatna-in amang chaovin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chukal valin natongho hoppeh dinga akhutnuva sum apehlutna houchun tahsan umtah-a abol jeh-un, amaho chu avesuisam pouvin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pakai in'a chun suhkhelna sumho le chonsetna sumho chu achoilutji pouve. Hichu thempu ho-a ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chujouvin Syria lengpa Hazael achetouvin, Gath agasatnin alatai. Chuin Hazael chu Jerusalem lam ngan achetoutai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chuin Juda lengpa Jehoash'in apu apate Judah lengho Jehoshaphat, Jehoram chule Ahaziah tehon anakatdoh-u thil thengho jouse, ama thilthengho jouse, chule Pakai in le lengpa in goukhol na-a kimu sana jouse chu alasoh keijin, Syria leng Hazael chu athotnin: chuin Jerusalem'a konin apotdohtai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chuin Jehoash thilbol danghole anatoh jouse chu Judah lengte thusimbua kisun hilouham?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chuin asohte akipat doh-un, achang lhiuvin, Jehoash chu Millo in'a Silla jotsuhna-a chun athat taove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ajehchu asoh teni, Shimeath chapa Jozachar le Shomer chapa Jehozabad chun avoh lhona, thia ahi. Chuin amahon David khopi-a apu apatetoh avuitha taove. Chuin achapa Amaziah ama khelin alengchang tai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah leng Ahaziah chapa Joash lengchan kal kum somlethum lhin kum-in, Jehu chapa Jehoahaz chu Israelte chunga Samaria'a alengchang panin, kum somle kum sagi alengchange.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chuin Pakai mitmun thil phaloutah abol jingin, Israelte chonset sahpa Nebat chapa Jeroboam chonsetna chu ajuijingin; chua konin akichoidohpoi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chuin Pakai lungsat chu Israelte chunga asoujah jengin, Syria lengpa Hazael khut le Hazael chapa Benhadad khutna ahinkho lhumkeijun apedoh tan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chuin Jehoahaz'in Pakai henga ngehna aneijin, Pakaiyin angaipehtai. Ajehchu Syria lengpan amaho asuh genthei jeh-in, Israelte kisuh gentheina chu amupehtan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />(Chuin Pakaiyin Israel chu huhhingpu khat ahinpen, hitichun amaho Syria mite khutnoija konin apotdoh taovin: Israel chate chu masanga bangin aponbuh uva acheng taove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahijeng vangin Israel chonsetsah Jeroboam insung chonset na-a konin amaho ahaideh pouvin, hiche achun aumjinguvin; chule Samaria gama chun thingbom jong aumjing nalaijin ahi).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jehoahaz chun amite lah-a sakol chung toumi somnga toh, kangtalai somtoh, keng sepai sangsom tilou aneiding aphalpeh louvu ahi. Ajehchu Syria lengpan asuhmanghela, phola leivui banga asem ahitai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tun Jehoahaz thilbol dangho, anatohho jouse le athil bolthei naho chu Israel lengho thusimbua kisun hilouham?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chuin Jehoahaz chu apu apate toh alumkhomin, Samaria'a avuitaove. Chuin achapa Joash ama khelin alengchang tai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chuin Judah lengpa Joash lengchan kal kum somthumle kum sagina-in, Jehoahaz chapa Jehoash chu Israelte chunga Samaria'a alengchang panin, kum somle kumgup alengchange.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chuin aman Pakai mitmu-a thilphalou anaboljin; Israelte anachonsetsah Nebat chapa Jeroboam chonset naho-a konin ana kikangsepon; hichea chun achon jingin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chule Joash thilbol danghole anatoh jouse, Judah leng Amaziah asatna athilbol theinaho chu Israel lengho thusimbua kisun hilouham?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chuin Joash chu apu apate toh alumkhomin, chuin Jeroboam chu alaltouna-a atoutai. Chuin Joash chu Samaria'a Israel lengho toh akivui khomtai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tun Elisha chu athipi khop hel ding natna-in ahung natan ahi. Chuin Israel lengpa Joash chu ahenga ahungsuh-in, amaichunga chun akapmin, vo hepa, hepa Israelte kangtalai le sakol touthemho, atin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chuin Elisha'n ajah-a, thalpi le thalchang ho hinlan, ati. Chuin aman ahenga thalpi le thalchang ho ahinlatai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chuin aman Israel lengpa jah-a, thalpi chunga chun nakhut koijin, ati. Chuin aman achunga akhut akoijin; chuin Elisha'n lengpa khut chunga chun akhut akoitai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chuin aman, solamsang bangkot hongtemin, ati. Chuin hichu ahongtai. Chuin Elisha'n, kapmin, ati. Chuin akaptai. Pakaiya kon huhdohna thalchang, Syria te-a kona huhdohna thalchang ahi. Ajehchu nangman Syria mite Aphek mun'a nasuh manghel kahse-a nasatding ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chuin aman, thalchang ho chu lan, ati. Chuin aman alatai. Chuin aman Israel lengpa jah-a, tolchu jepmin, ati. Chuin aman thumvei ajepmin, angatai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chuin Pathen mipa chu achunga alungsatan, ajah-a, ngavei, gupvei najep dingdol ahi; chutile Syria te chu nasuhmang hel kahse-a najep ding ahin; ahinla tun Syria te chu thumvei sehbou najoding ahitai, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chuin Elisha athitan amahon avuitaove. Chuin kum hunglhung chun Moab miten ahon honin gamchu ahinsatnun ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chuin ahitin ahi, mikhat vuiding agot laitah-un, vetan, amahon mihonpi khat amuvin; chuin mipa chu Elisha lhansunga alehlut taove. Chuin mipa chu akilelhah-a Elisha gu atohkhah phatnin, amachu ahingdoh-in, akengin adingdohtai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahin Syria lengpa Hazael chun Jehoahaz nikho pumpi chun Israelte asugentheijin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahivangin Pakaiyin Abraham, Isaac, Jacob henga athutep jeh-in amaho chu alungsetnin, achunguva lainatna aneijin, chule angaisah-in; asumang nompon, chujongle a-ansunga konin apaidoh nompon ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hitichun Syria lengpa Hazael chu athitai; chuin achapa Benhadad ama khelin alengchang tai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Apa Jehoahaz khutna kona gala aman analahdohsa khopiho chu, Jehoahaz chapa Jehoash'in Hazael chapa Benhadad khutna konin alakit tai. Amachu Joash'in thumvei ajouvin, Israelte khopiho chu alelah kit tai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel leng Jehoahaz chapa Joash lengchan kal kumni na-in, Judah leng Joash chapa Amaziah ahung lengchange.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama alengchan phatchun kum somni le nga ahitan, Jerusalem'a kum somni le kumko alengchange. Chule anu minchu Jehoaddan ahin, Jerusalem mi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chule aman Pakai mitmun adihchu abolin, ahinla apa David bang ahi hihlaije: aman apa Joash boljouse chu anabolin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahijeng vangin munsang ho chu akiladoh dehpon; munsang ho-a chun mipi ho chun ganlhaina le gimnamtui halna anei jiuvin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chuin ahung hitin ahi, lenggam chu ama khutna ahungdet detchun, apa lengpa anathat sohte chu ahin thatnin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahinla Mosi Danbua, chate jeh-a pate thading ahipon, pate jeh-a jong chate thading ahipoi, ahinla amitakip ama ama chonsetna jeh-a kithat ding ahi, tia kisun Pakai danthupeh anakisunsa bangin; tolthat ho chate chu anathatpon ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Edom mite chu chi phaichama sangsom athatnin, Selah khochu galin alan, hiche minchu tunichan geijin Joktheel asah-un ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chujouvin Amaziah chun Israel lengpa, Jehu chapa Jehoahaz chapa Jehoash henga mi thupole mi asolin, hungin kimaiton khatle khat kivehite, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chuin Israel lengpa Jehoash'in Judah lengpa Amaziah henga, Lebanon'a um meithai seltho lingin Lebanon'a um Cedar jah-a, kachapa jiding nachanu neipen ati. Chuin hiche munachun Lebanon gamsa khat ahungin meithai seltholing chu achonlhu deltan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nangman Edom chu najo tahbeh ahin, chule nalungthim chu kichoisang ahitai. Hiche-a chun loupi inlang, in'a kiumthimin; ajehchu ipidinga nangin nalungthima nangmatah le Judah mite toh lhuhtha nading nangaito dingham? ti thu agah thottai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahinla Amaziah chun ngaipeh-in aneipon ahi. Hijeh chun Israel lengpa Jehoash akontouvin, amale Judah lengpa Amaziah chu Judah gam Bethshemesh'a khatle khat akimaito lhontan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chuin Israelte masanga chun Judah chu amaimoh taovin; hichun mitin aponbuh lam cheh-a ajamtaove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chuin Israel lengpa Jehoash'in, Ahaziah chapa Jehoash chapa Amaziah Judah lengpa chu Bethshemesh'a amanin, chule Jerusalem'a ahungin, Jerusalem kulpi chu Ephraim kotpi apat aninglama kotpigei tong jalijen asuchimin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chuin Pakai inle leng in'a gou kholkhom na-a kimu sana le dangka jouse, chule um le bel manchah jouse alan, Samaria'a akiletai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tun Jehoash'in atohdoh athilbol dangho jouse le athilbol theina, chule Judah leng Amaziah asatdanho chu Israel lengte thusimbua kisunlutna hilouham?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chuin Jehoash chu apu apate toh alumkhomin, Israel lengte toh Samaria'a avuitaove; chuin achapa Jeroboam akhelin alengchang tan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chuin Judah lengpa Joash chapa Amaziah chu, Israel leng Jehoahaz chapa Jehoash thinungin kum somle kum nga ahing nalaije.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chule Amaziah thilbol dangho chu Judah lengho thusimbua kisun hilouham?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chule tun amahon ama dounan Jerusalem'a thilguh agongun; chuin ama Lachish lama ajamin, ahinla Lachish lama anunga mi asolun, hiche munachun athat taove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chuin amahon sakol in ahinpouvin, David khopi Jerusalem'a apu apate toh avuitha taove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chuin Judah mipite jousen kum somle kum gup lhingbep Azariah chu apuijun, apa Amaziah khelin alengchansah taove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aman Elath kho chu asadoh-in, Judah gama aumsah kitnin, hiche jouchun lengpa chu apu apate toh alumkhom tai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Judah leng Joash chapa Amaziah lengchan kal kum somle kumnga alhinnin, Israel lengpa Joash chapa Jeroboam Samaria'a alengchang panin; kum somli le kum khat aleng changin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chuin Pakai mitmun thilse abolin, Israelte chonsetsah Nebat chapa Jeroboam chonsetna jouse-a konin akikangse pon ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Pakai Israel Pathen'in Gath-hepher'a um Amittai chapa asoh themgao Jonah khutna athusei bangin, Hamath lutna-a kona phaicham luipi geijin Israel gamchu alelah kit tai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ajehchu Pakaiyin Israelte nasatah-a athohgimnao chu amun; ajehchu akihen oh-a hihen, akilha onga hile Israelte kithopi ding koimacha aumlou amun ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Pakaiyin Israelte minhi vannoi'a kona asuhmang ding anaseipon; Joash chapa Jeroboam khutna konin amaho chu ahuhdohjon ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tun Jeroboam thilbol danghole anatoh jouse, chule athilbol theina, agal boldan, chule aman tumasanga Judah te chan anahijing Damascus le Hamath kho Israelte dia ahin lelahlut thuho hi Israel lengte thusimbua kisunlut hilouham?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chuin Jeroboam chu apu apate, Israel lengte ngeitoh analum khomin; chule achapa Zekeriah ama khelin alengchang tan ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel leng Jeroboam lengchan kal kum somni le kum sagina-in, Judah leng Amaziah chapa Azariah alenchang panin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Alengchan patchun kum somle kumgup ahin, Jerusalem'a kum somnga le kumni alengchange; chule anu minchu Jecholiah ahin, Jerusalem mi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chuin aman apa Amaziah boljouse dungjuijin Pakai mitmu-a adih chu abolin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Munsang ho-a bouchu achonmang dehpon; mihon munsang ho-a chun ganlhaina le gimnamtui hal aboljing nalai uve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chuin Pakaiyin lengpa chu adengin, hitichun athi nikho geijin aphah-in, intumbeh-a achengtai. Chule leng chapa Jotham chu gamsung mite vaihomin insunglam vaipon apangtai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chule Azariah thilbol danghole anatohho jouse chu Judah lengte thusimbu kisutlutna-a kisunlutna hilouham?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hitichun Azariah apu apate toh alumkhomin, chule amahon David khopi-a apu apate toh avuitaove. Chuin ama khelin achapa Jotham alengchang tai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Judah lengpa Zakariah lengchankal kum somthumle kum get lhin na-in, Jeroboam chapa Zakariah chu Israelte chunga Samaria'a lhagup alengchange.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chule apu apate bolbangin Pakai mitmun dihloutah abol jingin, Israelte chonsetsah-a Nebat chapa Jeroboam chonset naho-a konin akiheimang dehpoi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chuin Jabesh chapa Shallum'in ama douna-in thilguh agongin, miho anga ajepmin, athatnin, akhelin alengchang tai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chule Zakariah thilbol dangho chu vetan Israel lengte thusimbu sunga akisunin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hichehi Jehu henga Pakaiyin thu aseichu ahin, Nachapate chu Israelte laltouna-a khangli geija toudiu ahi tin aseije. Chuin hitichun aguilhung tan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Juda lengpa Uzziah lengchan kal kum somthumle kumko lhin kum-in, Jabesh chapa Shallum chu alengchang panin, Samaria'a lhakhat lhingset alengchange.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ajehchu Gadi chapa Menahem chu Tirzah'a konin achetouvin, Samaria'a ahungin, Samaria'a Jabesh chapa Shaallum chu avon, athatnin, ama khelin alengchang tai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chule Shallum thilbol danghole ama thilguh gonho chu, veuvin, Israel lengte thusimbu sunga akisunlut tan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chuin Menahem'in Tirzah le asunga umjouse, chule agamsung chu Tirzah'a patnin asatnin ahi. Ajehchu ama henga akipehlut loujeh uva asat ahin, chule chuche sunga um numei naovop jouse chu agai akhepeh-in ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Judah leng Azariah lengchan kal kum somthumle kum ko na-in, Gadi chapa Menahem Israelte chunga ahung lengchang panin, Samaria'a kum som alengchange.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chule aman Pakai mitmun thilse abol jingin, Israelte chonsetsah Nebat chapa Jeroboam chonset na-a konin ahinkho lhumkeijin akihei mangpon ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chuin Assyria leng Pul chu agamu dounan ahungkonin; chule Menahem'in lenggam chu akhutna suhdet ahina dinga akhut chun aumpina dingin, Pul chu dangka talent sangkhat apen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chuin Menahem'in Israelte mihaoho sum jouse chu, mikhat khatna dangka shekel somnga cheh Assyria lengpa pehdingin adongin ahi. Hitichun Assyria lengpa akinunglen gamsunga aumdenpoi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chuin Menahem thilbol danghole atoh jouse chu Israel lengho thusimbua kisun hilouham?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chuin Menahem chu apu apate toh alum khomin, ama khelin achapa Pekahiah alengchang tai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Judah lengpa Azariah lengchan kal kum somnga na-in, Menahem chapa Pekahiah chu Israelte chunga Samaria'a aleng changin, kumni lengvai apon ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chule Pakai mitmun thilse abol jingin, Israelte chonsetsah Nebat chapa Jeroboam chonset naho-a konin akikangsepoi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chuin agal lamkai Remaliah chapa Pekah chun guhthimin thilgon aneijin, Samaria leng inpi sunga Argob le Arieh chule akiloipi Gilead mi somnga chutoh avouvin; chule athatnin, a-indan sunga alengchang tai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chule veuvin Pekahiah thilbol danghole atoh jouse chu Israel lengte thusimbua akisunlut cheh-e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Judah leng Azariah lengchankal kum somnga le kum ni kum-in, Remaliah chapa Pekah chu Israelte chunga Samaria'a alengchang panin, kum somni alengchange.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chule aman Pakai mitmu-a aphalou chu abol jingin, Israelte chonsetsah Nebat chapa Jeroboam chonset naho-a konin akikangsepoi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Israel leng Pekah lallaijin, Assyria leng Tiglath-pileser ahungin Ijon, Abel-beth-maachah, Janoah, Kedesh, Hazor, Gilead, Galilee, chule Naphtali gam pumpi alan, Assyria gama amaho chu gal hingin akaitai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Chuin Elah chapa Hoshea chu Remaliah chapa Pekah dounan guhthimin thilgon aneijin, asatnin, athatnin; Uzziah chapa Jotham lengchan kal kum somni na-a chun akhelin alengchang tai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chule Pekah thilbol danghole atohjouse, veuvin, hicheho chu Israel lengte thusimbua kisunlutna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Israel lengpa Remaliah chapa Pekah lengchankal kumni na-in, Judah leng Uzziah chapa Jotham chu alengchang pantai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Alengchan patchun kum somni le kum nga ahitan, Jerusalem'a kum somle kumgup aleng changin ahi. Chule anu minchu Jerusha ahin, Zadok chanu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hitichun aman Pakai mitmu-a adih chu abolin; aman apa Uzziah boljouse bangchun abolin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Hitajongle munsang ho chu akiladohpon, miho chun munsang ho-a chun ganlhaile gimnamtui hal aboljing nalai uve. Aman Pakai in kotpi chungnung chu asan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tun Jotham thilbol danghole anatohho chu Judah lengho thusim kisutlutna lekhabua kusuna hilouham?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Hiche laichun Pakaiyin Syria leng Rezin le Remaliah chapa Pekah chu Judah te doudin asol pantan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Chuin Jotham chu apu apate toh alumkhom tan, chule apa David khopi-a apu apate toh akivuitha tai. Chule achapa Ahaz chu ama khelin ahung lengchangtai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Remaliah chapa Pekah lengchankal kum somle kum sagina-in, Judah lengpa Jotham chapa Ahaz chu alengchang panin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahaz ahung lengchan patchun kum somni ahin, chule Jerusalem'a kum somle kum get vai apon, aman apa David bangin Pakai Pathen mitmun thildih abolpon ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahin Israel lengte lamlhah jouse chu ajotnin; chule Israel chate masanga kona Pakaiyin apaidoh Pathen helouhon abolu thet umtah dungjuijin, achapa chu meija aselutsah-in ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chule munsang ho le lhangho, chule thinghing jouse noija ganlhaina le gimnamtui ahaljin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chuin Syria leng Rezin le Israel lengpa Remaliah chapa Pekah chu Jerusalem'a gal bolin ahungtou lhonin; chule Ahaz chu aumun, ahinla amachu ajoujou lhonpoi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hiche laichun Syria lengpa Rezin'in Elath chu Syria gamdin alelah-in, Judah te chu Elath'a konin adelmangin, Syria te chu Elath na ahungun tugeijin achenguve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hijeh chun Ahaz'in Assyria lengpa Tiglath-pileser henga thupole asolin; keima nasoh le nachapa kahi; hungtouvin lang eidou dinga hungkipat doh-a Syria lengpa le Israel lengpa khutna konin neihuh doh-in, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chuin Ahaz'in Pakai in'a dangka le sana umjouse, chule leng in'a gou kholkhom na-a umjouse alan, Assyria lengpa chu thilmoh peh din athottai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chuin Assyria lengpa chun athu angai pehtai; ajehchu Assyria lengpa chu Damascus dounan achetouvin, alan, amite chu Kir gama gal hingin akaijin, Rezin chu athat tai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chuin Ahaz lengpa chun Assyria lengpa Tiglath-pileser chu kimupi ding Damascus'a achen, chule Damascus'a um maicham khat agamun ahi. Chule maicham lim le akisem dan, chule akigon bangtah chun, lengpan Uriah thempu agah thotnin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chuin Uriah thempu chun Ahaz lengpan Damascus'a kona ahinthot dungjui chun maicham asemin; hitichun Uriah thempupan Damascus'a kona leng Ahaz ahung kilekah-in anasem joutan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chuin Damascus'a kona lengpa ahung chun, lengpan maicham chu amun; chule maicham chu anailutnin, hichea chun thilto atohtai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chuin aman govam thilto le anneh thilto ahalin, chule donding thilto alheijin, maicham chung chu chamna thiltoho thisan chu athe khumin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chuin houin maija kon, maicham thah le Pakai in kikah-a konin, Pakai masanga um sum-eng maicham jongchu aladoh-in, maicham sahlam panga chun akoitai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chuin Ahaz lengpan Uriah thempu jah-a, maicham len chungahin jingkah govam thilto, nilhah anneh thilto, lengpa govam ganlhai, a-anneh thilto, chule gamsunga mijouse govam thilto, anneh thilto, chule dontho thilto toh-in; chule hiche chunga chun govam thilto thisan le kilhaina thilto jouse thisan chu thekhumin; sum-eng maicham vangchu keima houna ding ahi, tin athupeh-in ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hitichun Uriah thempu chun Ahaz lengpa thupeh jouse dungjuijin aboltai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chuin Ahaz lengpan agamgi geisihho chu akhin neovin, hicheho-a konchun kisilna kong chu achondoh-in, twidol chu anoija um sum-eng bongchal ho-a konin alalhan, songlhongnal chunga atungtai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chule houin sunga choldoni-a dinga pondal abolule, polama lengpa lutna chu Assyria lengpa jeh'in Pakai in'a konin atoldohtai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tun Ahaz thilbol thusim dangho ama natohho chu Judah lengte thusimbu ho-a kisunlutna hilouham?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chuin Ahaz apu apate toh alumkhomin, chule David khopi-a apu apate toh avui khomuve. Chuin achapa Hezekiah chu ama khelin alengchang tai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah lengpa Ahaz lengchan kal kumsomle kum ni na-in, Elah chapa Hoshea chu Israelte chung Samaria'a alengchang panin, kum ko alengchange.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chuin Pakai mitmu-a thilphalou chu anabolin, ama masanga Israel lengho tobang anahipon ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Assyria lengpa Shalmaneser chu ama dounan ahung kontouvin; chule Hoshea chu asoh-in ahungpangin, thilpeh ho apen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chuin Assyria lengpan Hoshea thilguh gonchu amudohtai: ajehchu aman Egypt lengpa So henga thu pole asolin, akumseh-a abolngai bangin Assyria lengpa henga thilpeh ahinpe tapon ahi. Hijeh chun Assyria lengpan songkul'a ahenin, akhachah khumtai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chuin Assyria lengpan gamjouse ahin banchot touvin, Samaria'a achen, kumthum hel aum khumtai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hoshea lengchan kal kumko lhinkum chun Samaria alan, Israelte chu Assyria gama atol mangin, Gozan vadunglen pama Medes te khopiho Halah le Habor'ah aumsah taovin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ajehchu ana hitin ahi, Egypt gama konle Egypt lengpa Pharoah khutnoija kona ahinpuidoh uva, Pakai a-Pathen'u dounan achonse taovin, chule pathen dangho joh aging taovin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amahon Israel chate masanga kona Pakaiyin ana nodohsa Pathen hephalouho, chule amahon akitun'u Israel leng teho chonnadan chu ajuijun, ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chule Israel chaten Pakai a-Pathen'u dounan guhthimin adihlou thilho chu anabolun; chule akhopiho jouse-a, khongahpa insangho-a pat, kulnei khopi geijin munsang ho akisemun ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chule lhangsang jouse le thingphung hing jouse noija, milimho le thingbomho akitundoh-un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chule chua munsang ho jouse-a, Pakaiyin amasanguva kona apaidoh Pathen hephalouho bangin gimnamtui ahalun; Pakai lunghana sodohna dingin thilphalou agongun ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ajehchu Pakaiyin ahenguva, hitobanghi bolhih-un anati, milimho chu anajenun ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahin Pakai chun themgao jousele mitvahneiho jouse-a konin, Israelte le Judah te douna chu ana phongdoh jin, ahenguva, nakhangitlou naova konin hung kiheijun lang, naheng uva kasohte themgaoho kahinsola, napateu henga kathupeh ho jouse dungjuijin, kachondanho le kathupeh ho nit uvin, anati jin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Achuti vangin amahon angai hih-un, Pakai a-Pathen'u ana tahsan lou apu apateu ngong bangin, angongu ahamsah-un ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chule amahon apu apateu toh asemu achondanhou le akitepna, chule ahenguva athu hettohsah ho chu asandauvin; pannabei nungchu ajuijun, pannabei asoh-un, achung changuva Pakaiyin amaho bangin umhih-un anati, akimveluva Pathen hephalouho nung ajuijun ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chule Pakai a-Pathen'u thupeh jouse adalhaovin, akilhajol bongnou lim nitoh akisemun, thingbom akisemun, van janelpi ahouvun, Baal ajentaove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chule achapateule achanuteu mei apalsah-un, aisan le lhimna amangun, ama lungsat sah-a lung hansah nadin Pakai mitmun thilsetah boldingin akijoh doh-un ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hijeh chun Israelte chunga Pakai alunghang behsetnin, amuphahna louva achon mangin; Judah phung tailou khatcha akhen aumtapoi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Judah jongchun a-Pakai Pathen'u thupeh chu anit tapon; ahinla Israel ten akisemu chondan kisema chun achontaove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chuin Pakaiyin Israel chilhah jouse chu adeitapon, asugentheijin, amitmua kona apaidoh kahsen michom mangho khutna chun apedohtan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ajehchu Israel chu David insunga konin abottelin, chule amahon Nebat chapa Jeroboam chu lengin asemun; chuin Jeroboam'in Israelte chu Pakai ajuijuva konin anomangin, amaho chu chonsetna lentah-in achonset sahtai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ajehchu Israelte chu Jeroboam'in abol chonsetna jouse-a chun achonseuvin, hicheho-a konchun akiheimang theipouvin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Asohte themgaoho jouse kama anasei bangin, Pakaiyin amitmua kona achon manghel kahsen hicheho-a konchun akichoidoh pouve. Hitichun atolmangin tunigeijin achengden taove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chuin Assyria lengpan Babylon'a kon, Cuthah'a kon, Ava'a kon, Hamath'a kon, chule Sepharvaim'a konin mi ahinpuijin; Israel chate khelin Samaria'a achensahtai. Amahon Samaria alovin, chua khopiho-a chun acheng taove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chuin ahitin ahi, chua achentilu chun, Pakai chu aging pouvin; hijeh chun Pakaiyin alah uva keipi bahkai asollin, mi phabep athatnin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hijeh chun amaho Assyria lengpa henga, nangman nachon doh-a, Samaria khopi-a nachensah nam mite hin, hichegam Pathen houdan ahepouve. Hijeh chun aman alah uva keipi bahkai ahinsolin, vetan, hiche gam Pathen houdan ahetlou jeh-un, amaho chu athat taove, atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chuin Assyria lengpan thu apen, khulama kona nahin puiho thempuho lah-a khat puijun lang; chule chua gacheng hen, chule chugam Pathen houdan chu amaho gahil hen, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chuin Samaria'a kona ahin puidoh hou lah-a thempu khat ahungin, Bethel'a achengin, amaho chu Pakai ginje ahiltan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hijongle namtinin ama amacheh pathen akisemun, Samaria ten akisemu munsang ho, inho, chule namtinin achennao khopiho-a hicheho chu akikoicheh uve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Chuin Babylon miten Succoth-benoth asemun, Kuth miten Nergal asemun, Hamath miten Ashima asemun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Avi miten Nibhaz le Tartak semun, chule Sepharv miten achateu chu Sepharvaim pathenho Adram-melech le Anam-melech henga din meija agou jiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hitichun Pakai chu agingun, chule alah uva anempenho chu munsang ho-a thempun akisemun, munsang inho-a chun kilhaina aneijiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Amahon Pakai chu agingun, chule chua kona apuimangu namho houdan dungjuijin, amaho pathenho chu ajen jiuvin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tumasanga aboldan bangun tulai geijin abolun; Pakai chu agingpouvin, aman Israel tia aminvo Jacob chateho chonna dan kisunle houdan thupeh ho, chule Pakaiyin apeh dan thupeh ho jongchu anitpouvin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Amaho chutoh Pakaiyin kitepna asema, amaho chu athu lhah-a, nanghon pathen dangho naginloudiu, a-anguva jong nakunloudiu, jenjong najen loudiu, ahenguva jong naki lhai loudiu;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Amavang thilboltheina nasatah le banjah puma Egypt gama kona napuidoh pao Pakai chu naginuva, nahou uva, ama hengabou kilhaina nabol dingu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Aman nangho dinga asut achondanho, houdanho, dan, chule danthupeh chu a-imatih chana chingthei tah-a nanit dingu; pathen dangho nagin loudingu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Chule nangho toh kitepna kasemhi nasuhmil loudingu, pathen dangho jong nagin louhel dingu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ahinla Pakai na Pathen'u chu nagin dingu; aman namelma teu jouse khutna kona nahuhdoh dingu ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Achutijeng vangin amahon angaideh pouvin, tumasanga aumdanu bou abol jingun ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Hitihin hiche nam mite hin Pakai chu agingun, amilim semthu chu apu apateu vin anajen bangun, achateu le achate chateuvin jong ajenun; hitichun tulai geihin abolun ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tun ahitin ahi, Elah chapa Israel leng Hoshea lengchan kal kum thum na-in, Judah lengpa Ahaz chapa Hezekiah chu ahung lengchang panin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama alengchan patchun kum somni le kum nga ahin; chule ama Jerusalem'a kum somni le kum ko alengchange. Anu minchu Abi ahin, Zachariah chanu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aman apa David'in anabol jouse dungjuijin, Pakai mitmun adih chu abolin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Munsang ho chu achon mangin, milimho chu asubongin, thingbomho aphuh lhun, Mosi'n anasem sum-eng gul chu avobongsele; ajehchu hiche nikholai geija chu Israel chaten hiche henga chu gimnamtui ahaljiu ahin; chule aman hichu Nehushtan asah-e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aman Pakai Israel Pathen atahsanin; hitichun ama nungin Juda lengte jouse lah-a ama tobang aum tapon, ama masangin jong khatcha anaumpoi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ajehchu Pakai atuhchah-in, ama ajuija konin achemangpon, Pakaiyin Mosi anapeh thuho chu anit jingin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chule Pakaiyin aumpin, achedohna lamjousea aphattheijin; Assyria lengpa dounan akiphinin, ama chu ajenpon ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Philistine te chu Gaza kho le agamgi chin gei, khongah ho insanga pat khopi kulnei geijin abantha gamin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chuin Hezekiah lengchan kumli alhinin, Israel leng Elah chapa Hoshea kum sagi alengchan kum-in ahitin ahi. Assyria leng Shalmaneser chu Samaria satdin ahung kontouvin, Chule aum kultan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chuin kumthum kichaijin alataovin ahi: Hezekiah lengchan kal kum gup lhina, Israel lengpa Hoshea lengchankal kum ko na-in, Samaria chu lah-in aumtan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chuin Assyria lengpan Israelte chu Assyria-a apuimangin, Halah'a Gozan vapi pama Habor chule Medes khopiho-a chun amahochu akoitan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ajehchu amahon Pakai a-Pathen'u aw angaipouvin, akitepna le Pakai soh Mosi athupeh jouse asukhelun, ajui nomhih-un, boljong abolpouve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tun Hezekiah Lengpa lengchan kal kum somle kum li lhinin, Assyria lengpa Sennacherib chu Judah gam khopi kulpi neijouse satdin ahungkon touvin, hicheho chu alatan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chuin Judah lengpa Hezekiah'in Lachish'a Assyria lengpa henga chun, thil kanabol kheltan ahi, tin thu agah thottai. Chuin Assyria lengpa chun Hezekiah chu dangka talent jathum le sana talent somthum atep pehtan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chuin Hezekiah'in Pakai in'a dangka umjouse le leng in'a goukhol na-a dangka umjouse chu apetan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hiche phatlai chun Hezekiah'in Pakai in kotna sanale, Juda leng Hezekiah'in khompi ho-a sana alonkhumho chu akhohdoh sohkeijin, Assyria lengpa chu apetan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chuin Assyria lengpan Tartan le Rabsaris chule Rabshakeh chu Lachish'a konin sepai janeltoh Jerusalem'a Hezekiah lengpa henga asolin ahi. Chuin amaho achetouvun Jerusalem alhung taove. Chuin amaho alhunun, ponsoppa lamlhah-a twikul sahnung, twilam panga chun adinguve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chuin amahon lengpa akouvun ahile, insung vaipopa Hilkiah chapa Eliakim, lekhasunpa Shebna, chule thuchingpa Asaph chapa Joah chu ahungdoh-un ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chuin Rabshakeh chun ajah uva, tun nanghon Hezekiah henga gaseijun, leng loupitah, Assyria lengpan hitin aseije, ipi tahsana nakingaija kisong nahim?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nangman naseijin, (ahinla hicheho chu mohthu mai maibou ahi,) keiman galbol nadin thumopthem le thahatna kaneije nati. Tun koichunga natahsan nangapma, keima douna-a kiphin nahim?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tun, vetan, hiche pumpeng kihehchip tenggol Egypt mite ngeichu natahsan ahin; ama chunga chun mikhattou kingaitaleh, akhutna lutna chule asutding ahi. Egypt lengpa Pharoah tahsan jouse chu chutiding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahinla nanghon kahenga, Pakai ka Pathen'u katahsanu ahi, tijong leuchun, hiche munsang ho le maicham ho chu hilouham, Hezekiah'in alah manga, Judah le Jerusalem mite henga, Jerusalem'a um hiche maicham masanga hi nahoudiu ahi, ati chu?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hijeh chun tun kangeh nahiuve, ka pakai Assyria lengpa henga chun kitepna peuvin, chule achunga touding mi nanga jouding pou ule, sakol sangni napeu vinge.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Achutile iti dana kapupa sohteho lah-a gal lamkai neopen khat mai nahei manguva, Egypt mite kangtalai ho le sakol ho chunga natahsanu na-ngap muham?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tu-a hi keima Pakai thulouva hiche munhi satna sumang dinga hunga kahim? Pakaiyin kajah-a, heche gam dounan chetouvin, chule gasumangin eiti ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chujouvin Hilkiah chapa Eliakim, Shebna, chule Joah chun Rabshakeh jah-a, kangeh nahi, nasohte jah-a, Syria paovin thu seijin; ajehchu keihon kahecheh naove; chule kulpi vuma mipi jahdin Judah paovin neikihoupi hih-un, atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ahinla Rabshakeh chun ajah uva, kapu chun napu hengle nangma henga hiche thuho seidinga eihinsol ham? Kulpi vuma touho hin nang hotoh aeh-u aneh uva ajunu adon theina dinguva ahenguva eihinsol hilouham? ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chujouvin Rabshakeh adingin, Judah paovin aw sangtah-in asamin, thu aseijin, lenglen Assyria lengpa thu ngaijun;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Lengpan hitin aseije, Hezekiah chu kilheplhah sah hih-un; ajehchu aman ama khutna konin nahuhdoh jou pouvinte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Chule Hezekiah'in, Pakaiyin thonlouva eihuhdoh teidingu ahin, hiche khopihi Assyria lengpa khutna jong kipedoh louhel ding ahi, tin Pakai natahsan sah daohen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hezekiah thu ngai hih-un; ajehchu Assyria lengpan hitin aseije, thilpeh khatna konin keitoh kinoptona khat bolun lang kahenga hungun, hitichun mitinin alengpi gui cheh le atheichang phung cheh kineh hen, chule nangho mitinin atwibel cheh-u kidonuhen;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Thilouva nahina diuva nangho gam tobang gam, chang le lengpithei gam, changlhah le lengpilei gam, olive thao le khoiju lonna gam khatna dinga kahunga kahung puidoh kahseuvin: chule, Pakaiyin eihuhdoh naovinte tia najol tengule, Hezekiah thu ngai hih-un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Namtin pathenho lah-a khat tou Assyria lengpa khutna kona agam huhdoh-a umkha tam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hamath le Arpad pathenho hoija umtaovam? Sepharvaim, Hena, chule Ivah pathenho hoilamba hitaovam? Amahon kakhutna kona Samaria ahuhdoh beh uvem?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Gamsung pathenho jouse lah-a kakhutna kona agamu huhdohpeh-a koi uma, Pakai chun kakhutna kona Jerusalem ahuhdoh ding hijaham? ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ahinla mipi chu athipbeh-un, thu chengkhat chanjong adonbut pouve. Ajehchu lengpa thulhah chu, donbut hih-un, ti ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Chujouvin leng insunga vaihom Hilkiah chapa Eliakim le lekhasun Shebna chule thuchingpa Asaph chapa Joash chu Hezekiah henga aponu kibottel pumin ahungun, Rabshakeh thusei ho chu ama aseipeh-un ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chuin ahitin ahi, Hezekiah lengpan hichu ajah phatnin, apon abottelin, khaodippon akisilin, Pakai insunga alut tai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chuin insung vaipopa Eliakim, lekhasun Shebna, chule thempuho lah-a upaho chu khaodip pon kisil pumin, Amoz chapa Isaiah themgao henga asoltan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chuin amahon ajah-a, Hezekiah'in hitin aseije, tunihi lungjin nikho, kipho nikho, chule kitaitom nikho ahi: ajehchu naosen ho pengding aki gouvin, ahinla apenlhahsah nading thahatna aumpoi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Apu Assyria lengpan hingjing Pathen house dinga asolpa Rabshakeh thusei jouse chu Pakai na Pathen chun jatei tantin; Pakai na Pathen'in athu jahho chu phohsal nante. Hijeh chun amoh umnalai ho ding chun taona manpeh-in, atiuve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hitichun Hezekiah lengpa soh ho chu Isaiah henga ahungtaove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chuin Isaiah'in ajah uvah, napupao henga hiti nagasei dingu ahi; Pakaiyin hitin aseije, nathujah hou, Assyria lengpa sohten eitamsetnao thuho-a chun kicha hih-in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Veovin, achunga huihat kanunsah ding, chule aman thuthang ajah-a, agamlama kileding; agamsung tah-a chemhema kalousah ding ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hitichun Rabshakeh akiletan, Assyria lengpan Libnah anasat agatohkhai; ajehchu aman ama chu Lachish'a konin apot tai ti ajah ahitai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chule, Ethiopia leng Tirhakah chungchanga kisei, veuvin, nangma satdingin ahungkon dohtai ti thu ajah phatnin; Hezekiah henga thupole ho asolkitnin, ajah-a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hitia hi Judah lengpa Hezekiah henga naseidingu ahi, Assyria lengpa khutna Jerusalem kipedoh ponte tia natahsan pa na Pathen chu kilhep lhahsah hih-in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Veuvin, Assyria lengten gamjouse asuhmang hela, achunguva athilbol houchu najatan; achutile nangma huhhing-a na-umchom dehding ham?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kapu Kapa teovin anasuhmang Gozan, Haran, Rezeph, chule Thelasar kho-a um Eden chateho chu, namtin pathenho chun anahuhdoh beh-em?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hamath lengpa, Arpad lengpa, chule Sepharvaim khopi lengpa, Hena le Ivah lengpa hoija umgama hitaovam? agati sah-e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chuin Hezekiah'in thupo ho khutna lekhathot chu amun, asimtai. Chuin Hezekiah chu Pakai in'a achetouvin, hichu Pakai anga aphajaltan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chuin Hezekiah Pakai anga ataovin, Cherub teni kah-a cheng, vo Pakai Israel Pathen, nangma, nangma sehseh bou lenggam jouse-a Pathen nahin; nangman vanle lei nana seme.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pakai nanakhang hinsung inlang, ngaijin; Pakai namit hasah inlang hinven: chule Pathen hing taitom na-a Sennacherib i-sah louna thuseihi ngaijin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tahbeh-in, Pakai, Assyria lengten namtinle agamu asuhmang gamuva,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chule a-pathen hou meija alelutpeh gamu ahitai. Ajehchu amaho pathen ahi pouvin, mihem khutsem thingle songbou ahiuve: hijeh-a chu asuhmangu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hijeh chun tun, vo Pakai ka Pathen'u, kangeh nahi, leiset lenggam jousen nangma sehseh bou Pakai Pathen nahihi ahet theina diuvin, ama khutna konin neihuh doh-un, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chujouvin Amoz chapa Isaiah chun Hezekiah henga thu athotnin, hitin aseije, Pakai Israel Pathen chun hitin aseije, Assyria leng Sennacherib douna-a kahenga nataona chu kasangtai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hichehi achungchang thu-u Pakaiyin aseichu ahi; Nungah theng Zion chanu chun nahsah-in naneipon, i-sah louvin nanuisat in; Jerusalem chanun alu napei khume.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Koi nahousetna koi nataitom ham? Koichunga na aw nachoi sanga, namit nachung hasah ham? Israel mithengpa tah chunga ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nathu poleho mangchan Pakai chu nahousen, hitin naseijin, ka kangtalai ho tamtah toh Lebanon panga um molsang ho kahung lhungtoutan, chule chua Cedar thing sangtah tahho leh, chahthing phatah tahho kaphuh lhuhding; chule keima agamgi chin geija kalutna, Karmel gammang geija kalut ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Keiman kalaijin, gamdang twi kadonjin, kakengto hin kulpi kium khum vadungho chu kakan sahjin ahi, nati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Keiman hichehohi sotlaija iti kanabola, khanglui laija kanasemsa ahidan najah khah louham? Hicheho chu tu-a hi kagui lhunsah ahin, Khopi kul neiho chu nasuhchima bohse banga nasetvum ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hijeh chun asunguva chengho thalhoma ahiuvin, ameidoijuva, maimoh ahiuvin; amaho jaova hampaho, hamhing eng ho, in chunga hamhing keh bangle akikhanlhit kah-a golhaji chang tobang bep hiuva ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ahinla keiman nachenna, nahunglut le napotdoh, chule kachunga nalungsat kahenai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ajehchu kachunga nalunghan nale nakitomna kanakhang sunga ahunglut tan; hijeh-a chu ka ngakoi nanah-a kavo-a, nanephu-a kakamdal kakoi ding, nahungna lampia kakinung lesah ding nahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chule hichehi nangma dinga melchihna hiding ahi, tukum achama kehho naneh dingu, kum ni nateng hiche-a kona alikeh mama chu nanehdingu; kumthum nateng vangle nakitu uva na atdiu; chule lengpilei nabol uva, aga nanehdiu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Chule Judah insung mi ahoidoh amoh cheng chun ajungu noilama khothuh unting, chunglama aga asepdoh dingu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ajehchu Jerusalem'a kona amoh ho, Zion mola kona ahoidohho chu potdoh diu ahi. Janel Pakai tompan nachun hichehi abolding ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hijeh chun Assyria lengpa chungchang thu Pakaiyin hitihin aseije; ama hiche khopi sunga hunglut louding, thalchang khatjong akaplut louding, alumdal jong ahinpohlut louding, aumna ding kuljong asesang louhel ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ahungna lampi hiche mama-a chu kilekit ding, hiche khopi sunga hunglut louding ahi, tin Pakaiyin aseije.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ajehchu keima le keima kikhoh sahna jal le, kasoh David khohsahna jala, hiche huhdohna dinga kahonbit ding ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Chuin hiche janchun ahitin ahi, Pakai vantil chu akondoh-in, Assyria te gebuh-a chun sepai sangjakhat le sangsomget le sangnga athatnin ahi. Chuin amaho jingpitah-a athophatnun, veuvin, amaho abonchauvin mithilong ngen ahitaove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Hitichun Assyria lengpa Sennacherib chu apotdoh-in, akinunglen, Nineveh'a achengtai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Chuin ahitin ahi, aman a-pathen Nisroch in'a ama ahoupetnin, achapa teni Adram-melech le Sharezer'in chemjamin athat lhontan ahi. Chuin amani Armenia gama ajammang lhontai. Hichun achapa Esarhaddon ama khelin alengchang tai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hiche laichun Hezekiah chu thidingin anatan ahi. Chuin Amoz chapa Isaiah themgao chu ahenga ahungin, ajah-a, Pakaiyin hitin aseije, na insung kisemtoh-in; ajehchu nathi ding ahitan, nahinsot tahlou ding ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chujouvin amai banglama aheijin, Pakai henga ataovin, hitin aseije,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Vo Pakai, kangeh nahi, namasanga thutah le lungdih pu-a chule namitmu-a thilpha kanabolho chu tuhin neigeldoh pehtan, ati. Chuin Hezekiah hakan akaptai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chuin ahitin ahi, Isaiah chu hongsung lailunga apotdoh masangin, Pakai thu chu ahenga ahung lhungin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kilekitnin lang kamite vaipipo Hezekiah chu gaseipeh-in, Pakai, napa David Pathen chun hitin aseije, keiman nataona kasangin, namitlhi lon kamutai: ven, kadamsah ding nahitai. Nithum chan nile nangma Pakai in'a nachetou ding ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nahinkho kum somle kum nga kajopbea, nangmale hiche khopihi Assyria lengpa khutna kona kahuhdoh ding; chule hiche khopihi keima le keima kikhoh sahna jaleh kasoh David kakhohsahna jala kahonbit ding ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chuin Isaiah'in, theichang pheng khat hinlaovin ati. Chuin ahinlaovin uilut chunga chu akoijun ahile a-ol domtan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chuin Hezekiah'in Isaiah jah-a, Pakaiyin eidamsah dingle nithum ni-a Pakai in'a kachetou nading melchihna chu ipi hintem? ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chuin Isaiah'in, Pakaiyin aseisa chu aboltei ding ahi tihi nangma-a dinga Pakaiya kona namelchihna chu ahi: nilim chu kalsom machon dingham, ahiloule kalsom nungchon dingham? ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chuin Hezekiah'in adonbutnin, nilim dinga kalsom chesuh dinghi thil bailam ahin; hichu hidahen, ahinla nilim chu kalsom kinungchon johen, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chuin Isaiah themgao chu Pakai henga ataovin; Ahaz nidan melchih na-a kumlhasa nilim chu kalsom ahinlepui kitnin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hiche laichun Babylon lengpa Baladan chapa Berodach-baladan'in Hezekiah henga lekhathot le thilpeh ahinthotnin ahi: ajehchu aman Hezekiah chu anai ti ajan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chuin Hezekiah'in amahochu ana sasah-in, athillu koina in jouse, dangka, sanaho, gimnamtui ho, thao mantamho, agalvon koina in jouse, chule agou kholna-a umjouse avetsah sohkeijin; a-insungle alenggam jouse Hezekiah'in amaho amusahlou khatcha aumpon ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chujouvin Isaiah themgao chu Hezekiah lengpa henga ahungin, ajah-a, hiche teho hin ipi aseijum? hoija kona nahenga hunguva ham? ati. Chuin Hezekiah'in amaho gamlatah-a Babylon'a kona hunga ahiuve, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chuin aman, na insunga hi ipipi amutah um? ati. Chuin Hezekiah'in adonbutnin, ka-insunga thil umjouse amutaove; kagouho lah-a kavetsahlou khatchabeh aumpoi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chuin Isaiah'in Hezekiah jah-a, Pakai thuhi ngaijin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Vetan, na-insunga umjouse le napan tunigeija anakhol khomho chu Babylon gamsunga apohlutna dingu nikho hunglhung ding; imacha khen umlou ding ahi, tin Pakaiyin aseije.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chule nangma nahin, nangma-a kona hungpot ding nachapate chu apuimangdiu; chule amaho chu Babylon lengpa leng insunga Nukiso ho hiding ahiuve, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chuphatnin Hezekiah'in Isaiah henga, nangin naseidoh Pakai thuchu apha ahi. Chule aman, kahinkho sungbeh-a hi chamna le thutah aumle, hichu apha hijeng lou ham? ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chule Hezekiah thilbol danghole athaneina jouse, chule twikul le twilam iti asema, chule khopi sunga twi iti ana lahlut ham tiho chu, Judah lengte thusimbua kisunlutna hilouham?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chuin Hezekiah chu apu apate toh alumkhomin, chule achapa Manasseh chu ama khelin alengchang tai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Manasseh alengchan patchun kum somle kum ni ahin, ama Jerusalem'a kum somnga le kum nga analeng change. Chule anu minchu Hephzi-bah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chule aman Israelte masanga Pakaiyin ananodoh, Pathen helouho thil thet um bolji ho bangchun, Pakai mitmun thilse anabolin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ajehchu apa Hezekiah'in asuhmangsa munsang ho atungdoh kitnin; Israel leng Ahab bol bangin Baal maicham atungdoh in, thingbom asemin, van janelpi ahouvin, ajentaovin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pakaiyin Jerusalem'a kamin kaum sah ding ahi atina, Pakai in'a chun maicham ho asemin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chuin aman Pakai in hongsung teni-a chun van janelho jousedin maicham ho aseme.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chuin aman achapa chu meija kilhaina-in amangin, phat ho anitnin, kilhimna ho amangchan, lhakou le doithemho amangin: lungsat sah-a lunghansah nadin, Pakai mitmun khangitlouna tamtah abolin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aman thingbom milim asem chu Pakai in'a chun atungdoh-e, hiche houin chungchang hi Pakaiyin David le achapa Solomon henga, hiche in le Jerusalem hi a-imatih chana kamin umjing nadinga, Israel phung jouse-a kona kalhendoh ahin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Keiman amaho kathupeh jouse dungjuile, kasoh Mosi'n amaho athupeh jouse dungjuija boldinga anit pou ule, apu apateu kanapehna leisetna kona Israel ten akalu asondoh louhel dingu ahi, anati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahinla amahon angaipouvin; Pakaiyin Israel chate masanga anasuhmang namho bolsanga phaloujo cheh-in Manasseh'in miho chu alhemlha tai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chuin Pakaiyin asoh themgaoho-a thu aseijin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ajehchu Judah lengpa Manasseh in hichethil thet umtah abola, amaho masanga Amor mihon abol jouseu vuma giloutah-a abola, Judah jong milim houva achonsetsah jeh hin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hijeh chun Pakai Israel Pathen'in hitin aseije, veuvin, hiche thuhi ajapha chanin anakol teni kichih lahlah leuva ajah nadinga, keiman Jerusalem le Judah chunga thilse kalhunsah ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chule Samaria tena khao le Ahab insung tena thihkhai chu Jerusalem chunga kaman ding; min kong asoptheng banga Jerusalem kasuhtheng ding, chule kabung butun ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chule kagou chan amoh chengse chu kadalhah-a, amelmateu khutna kapehdoh ding; chule amaho amelmateuva dinga anchahle thil kichom hidiu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ajehchu apateu Egypt'a kona ahungdoh uva pat tunigei hin kamitmun thilphalou jeng aboluvin, kalunghan nadin eilungsat sah-un ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chukal vallin Manasseh hin themona bei thisan aso tambeh seh'in, Jerusalem dunglevai adip jengin; ama chonset tilouvin Judah jong achonsetsah-in, hitichun Pakai mitmun thilse jeng abolin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tun Manasseh thilbol danghole chonsetna abol hochu Judah lengte thusimbua kisuna hilouham?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chuin Manasseh apu apate toh alumkhomin; a-in'a ama honsungtah, Uzza honsunga avuitaovin: achapa Amon ama khelin alengchang tai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amon alengchan patchun kum somni le kumni ahin, Jerusalem'a kumni alengchange. Anu minchu Meshullemeth ahin, Jotbah kho-a Haruz chanu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aman apa Manasseh bolbangin Pakai mitmun thilphalou jeng abolin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chule apa chena lampi chu ajotnin, apan milim kin abol hochu abolin, amaho chu ahouvin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hitichun apu apate Pakai Pathen chu adalhan, Pakai lamlhah chu ajotpon ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chuin Amon sohte chun ama dounan guhthimin thilgon aneijun, lengpa chu ama in'a athat taove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ahinla chuche gam miho chun Amon lengpa changlhiho chu athatgam helun; chuche gam miho chun achapa Josiah chu ama khelin alengchansah taove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tun Amon'in anabol anatoh dangho chu Judah lengte thusimbua kisuna hilou ham?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chuin ama chu Uzza honsunga lhana chun avuijun, achapa Josiah ama khelin alengchang tai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Josiah chu alengchan kipat chun kum get ahin, ama Jerusalem'a kum somthumle kumkhat aleng changin ahi. Chule anu minchu Jedidah ahin, Boskath kho-a Adaiah chanu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chuin aman Pakai mitmu-a thil dihtah abolin, apa David lamlhah jouse ajotnin, jetle veija akiheidohpon ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chuin ahitin ahi, Josiah lengchan kumsomle kum getna-in, lengpan Meshullam chapa Azaliah chapa Shaphan lekhasun chu Pakai in'a asolin, aseije,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thempu chungnung Hilkiah henga chetouvin lang, kotngah hon miho-a kona alahkhomu, Pakai in'a kipo dangka chu simhen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chule Pakai in'a natongho vesuiho khutna pedoh uhen; chule amahon houin selai semphat nadingin, Pakai in'a um natongho,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thingthem bol hole insaho chule songthem bolho hengah, insemphat nading thingtumle song kikhengho choh nadingin peson uhen, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahivangin amahon tahsan umtah-a aboljeh-un, akhutnuva kipelut sumho chu vetsuina aumpoi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chuin thempu chungnung Hilkiah'in lekhasun Shaphan jah-a, danthupeh lekhabu chu Pakai in'a kamutai, ati. Chuin Hilkiah'in lekhabu chu Shaphan apen, aman hichu asimtan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chuin lekha sunpa Shaphan chu lengpa henga ahungin hitihin thu ahinlhut tai; nasohten in'a um sumho chu natongho khutna Pakai insa-a natongho apesoh hel taove, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chuin lekha sunpa Shaphan'in lengpa henga, Hilkiah thempupan lekhabu khat eipei, tin lengpa avetsah tai. Chuin Shaphan'in lengpa masanga hichu asimtai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chuin ahitin ahi, lengpan danthupeh lekhabua thuchu ajah phatnin, apon abottelin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chuin lengpan Hilkiah thempu, Shaphan chapa Ahikam, Michaiah chapa Achbor, lekhasun Shaphan, lengpa sohpa Asahiah chu thu apen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cheovin, Pakai chu keima dingle mipi ho-a ding, chule Judah te jousedin hiche akimudoh lekhabua thu umho chungchang thuhi neigadop peh-un; ajehchu ijuidiuva hiche lekhabua kijih jousehi ipu ipateovin ajuilou jeh-un, ichunguva Pakai lungsatna deujeju ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hitichun Hilkiah thempu, Ahikam, Achbor, Shaphan, Asahiah chu ponsil chingtupma pang Harhas chapa Tikvah chapa Shallum inneipi Huldah themgaonu henga acheuvin,(Amachu Jerusalem vengsahlama cheng ahin,) amanu aga kihoupiu vin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chuin amanun ajah uvah, Pakai Israel Pathen'in hitin aseije, kahenga nahinsolpao jah-a chun seipeh taovin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pakaiyin hitin ati, vetan, Judah lengpan asim lekhabua thucheng jouse banga chu, hikom munle asunga chengho jouse chunga thil phaloutah kalhunsah ding ahi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ajehchu akhutsohho jouse-a eilung hansah theina dinguvin, amahon keima eidalhao vin, pathen dangho henga gimnamtui ahaluvin ahi; hijeh-a chu hiche mun douna-a hi kalungsatna deujah jengding, chule kisumit louding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahinla Pakai dopdinga nahin soluvah Judah lengpa henga chun hitihin seijun, Pakai Israel Pathen'in hitin ati, nathu jah ho chungchanga;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hiche mun le asunga chengho chungchanga kathusei, amaho akamhel le sapset chang hung hidiu ahi tia kasei najah phatna nalung anema, Pakai anga nakineosah-a, napon nabotel jenga, kamasanga naka jeh-in; keiman nataona kasangtai tin Pakaiyin aseije.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hijeh chun vetan, keiman nangma napu napate henga kapuiding, nalhansunga lhamong tah-a kipuilut ding nahin; hiche mun'a thilse kalhunsah dingchu namitna namulouhel ding ahi, tin gaseipeh-un ati. Hitichun hiche thuchu lengpa henga agalhut taovin ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chuin lengpan mi asolin, Judah gam le Jerusalem'a upaho jouse ahenga akhomin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chuin lengpa chu Judah mi jousele Jerusalem'a cheng jouse, chule thempuho le themgaoho, chule mijouse, alenle aneo agomin amatoh Pakai in'a achetouvun; Pakai in'a kimu kitepna lekhabua thujouse chu nakhang jouse jah dingin asimin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chuin lengpa chu khompi koma adingin, Pakai nung juidingle, adan thupeh ho, athu hettohsah ho, achondan kisunho chu alungthim pumpi le ahinna pumpi-a juiding le, hiche lekhabua kisun kitepna ho jouse tongdoh dingin, Pakai angsunga chun kitepna aneijin ahi. Chule mipi jouse chun kitepna chu adin piuvin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chule lengpan thempu chungnung Hilkiah, anoidou thempuho, chule kotngah ho chu Baal ding, thingbom ding, chule van janelpi dinga kisem um le bel jouse Pakai in'a kona ladohdin thu apen ahi. Chuin aman hicheho chu Jerusalem pama Kidron loujaova agouvin, avamho chu Bethel'a apotai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chule aman milimhou thempuho, Judah khopiho le Jerusalem kimvel munsang ho-a gimnamtui haldia Judah lengten anapansah hou; Baal, nisa, lhathah, vantham jola umho, chule van janelho henga gimnamtui hal hochu, ahaisah gamtai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chule aman thingbom chu Pakai in'a konin Jerusalem pamlam, Kidron vachadunga apodoh-in; Kidron vachadunga ahalvamin, dijetnin achil ngemin, adi chu mipi ho chate buikhuh chunga apaijin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chule Pakai in koma pasal kijoh ho umna, thingbom dinga numei hon pon akhon jinao inho chu asuchim gamtan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chule Judah khopiho-a konin thempu jouse apuidoh-in, thempuho ginnamtui halna munsang ho Geba'a pat Bersheba geijin asuboh soh helin; khopi kotpi lutna veilam sanga khopi vaipo Joshua kotpi lutna-a munsang ho chu asuchimin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Munsang thempuho chu Jerusalem'a Pakai maichama ahunglou vangun, asopiteu lah-a chol solou changlhah vang ane naove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chule koimachan achapa ahiloule achanu Molech koma meija alelut louna din, Hinnom chate phaichama um Tophet chu asuboh'in ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chule Pakai in lutna, lengpa noidou Nathan-melech indan koma um, Judah lenghon nisa dinga apeh-u sakol ho chu aladoh-in; nisa kangtalai ho chu meijin ahalin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chule Ahaz indan chungnung vuma Judah lenghon maicham asemhou, chule Manasseh'in Pakai inhong teni sunga maicham asemho chu lengpan avochimin, asubongin, aleivuiju chu Kidron vachadunga apai lutnin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chule Jerusalem masang, kitahlouna molsang jetlama um munsang ho, Israel lengpa Solomon'in Zidon mite pathen thet umtah Ashtoreth ding, Moab miho Pathen thet umtah Chemosh ding, Ammon chate pathen thet umtah Milcom dinga anasah hochu, lengpan asubohtan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chuin milimho chu ahal halin asuchipmin, chule thingbomho chu aphuh lhun, amunho chun mihem gubuh-in adipme.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chukal valin Israelte chonsetsah Nebat chapa Jeroboam'in Bethel'a maicham le munsang asem munho chu asuchim soh-in; munsang chu ahalvamin, achil ngemin, thingbom chu ahalvamtai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chuin Josiah agakiheile mola lhanho chu ahinmun, mi asolin, lhana konin guho chu agalahsah-in, hiche thu anasei, Pathen mipan anaphondoh Pakai thu dungjuijin, maicham chunga chun ahalvamin, asubohtai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chuphatnin aman, khuche kagah mukhu ipi songphu ham? ati. Chuin khopi miho chun, Pathen mi, Judah gama kona hunga Bethel maicham chunga nathilbol saho hung seichoi masapa lhan ahi, tin ahiluve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chuin aman limsah hih-un, koiman aguchu suloh hih-un, ati. Hitichun Samaria'a kona hung kipotou themgaoho gutoh umkhom louvin, achomkoi taove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chule Israel lengten Pakai lunghan sahna-a asah-u, Samaria khopiho-a munsang inho jouse jongchu, Joshiah'in alamangin, Bethel'a abol bangin abolsoh keijin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chule munsang thempuho jouse jongchu maicham chunga athatnin; mi guho chu achunguva ahalin; chuin Jerusalem'a akiletai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chuin lengpan mijouse henga, hiche kitepna lekhabua kisun banghin, Pakai na Pathen'u henga kalchuh kut mangun, tin thu apei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tabbeh-in Israelte chunga thutan hon thu atan laijuva pat, Israel leng tele Judah lengte nikholai jousen jong, chutobanga kalchuh kut chu ana umkhapon ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Josiah lengchan kal kum somle kumget na-in, chuche kalchuh kut chu Jerusalem'a Pakai dingin ananei bepmun ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chukal valin Pakai in'a thempu Hilkiah'in amudoh lekhabua danthupeh kisunho suhbulhit ahina dingin, lhakou ho, doithemho, milimho, alim kisunthu bolho, chule le Judah gamle Jerusalem'a thil thet um amujiho jouse chu Josiah'in asumang soh hele.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mosi danthupeh dungjuija Pakai lama alungthim pumpi, alhagao pumpi, chule athaneinao pumpi-a kipe-a amatobang leng khatcha anaumpon, anungin jong ama tobang khatcha jong aum tapoi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Achuti jeng vangin Pakai chun alunghana tijat umtah, Manasseh'in alunghan sahna jouse jeh-a, Judah chunga alunghana deujejua konchun adai lhadeh pon ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chuin Pakaiyin, Israel kachon mang banga, Judah jonghi kamitmu-a kona kachon mang ding ahin; keiman kalhentum hiche khopi Jerusalem le, chu-a chu kamin umding ahi tia kanaseina hiche houin hi kapaidoh ding ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tun Josiah thilbol dangho le anatoh jouse chu Judah lengte thusimbua kisuna hilouham?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ama nikho laijin Egypt lengpa Pharoah-nechoh chu Assyria lengpa satdin Euphrates luipi-a akon touvin: chuin Josiah lengpa chu amapa kidoupidin achen; chuin Pharoah-nechoh'in ama amu phatnin Megiddo'a athat tai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Chuin asohten Megiddo'a konin kangtalai khatna athilong chu apouvin, Jerusalem alhutnun, amatah lhana avuitaove. Chuin gamsung mite chun Josiah chapa Jehoahaz apuijun, thao anuvin, apa khelin lengin apansah taove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jehoahaz alengchan patnin kum somni le kum thum ahin; Jerusalem'a lhathum aleng changin ahi. Anu minchu Hamutal ahin, Libnah'a Jeremiah chanu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Chule aman apu apate thilbol jouse bangin, Pakai mitmun thilphalou jeng abolin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Chuin Pharoah-nechoh chun Jerusalem'a alengchan theilouna dingin, Hamath gama um Riblah'a ahen nin; chule agamu chu dangka talent jakhat le sana talent khat kai apohsah tan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Chuin Pharoah-nechoh chun Josiah chapa Eliakim chu apa Josiah indan sunga chun alengchan sah-in, aminchu Jehoiakim'in akhelin, Jehoahaz chu apuimangtai. Chuin Pharoah'in Jehoahaz chu Egypt'a apuisuh-in, chua chun Jehoahaz athitai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Chuin Jehoiakim'in dangka le sana chu Pharoah apen; ahinla Pharaoh thupeh dungjuija sum pehdingin gamsung chu kai apohsah cheh-in ahi. Aman Pharoad-nechoh pehdinga mitin ateppeh cheh bangtah-in, chuche gam miho chu dangka le sana kaijin apehsah cheh-in ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Jahoiakim chu alengchan tilin kum somni le kum nga ahin, Jerusalem'a kum somle kum khat alengchange. Chule anu minchu Zebudah ahin, Rumah mi Pedaiah chanu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Chule aman apu apate bolho jouse bangin Pakai mitmun thilphalou ngen abolin ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ama nikho laichun Babylon lenga Nabuchadnezzar ahungtouvin, Jehoiakim chu kumthum asoh-in ahung pangin; chujouvin akile heijin chule ama douvin ahung pangtai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chuin Pakaiyin ama doudin Chaldea loiho, Syria loiho, Moab loiho, chule Ammon chate asolin, Pakaiyin themgaoho kama anasei thu dungjuijin, Judah douva sumangdingin asoltan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tabbeh-in Manasseh chonsetna ho jouse le athilbolho jouse dungjuija, amitmua kona chondoh nadinga, Pakaiya kona hiche thupeh hi hunglhunga ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chule themonabei thisan asojeh jong ahi: ajehchu Jerusalem chu monabei thisan sonan adiptan, Pakaiyin angaidam louding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tun Jehoiakim thilbol danghole atoh jouse chu Judah lengte thusimbua kisuna hilouham?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hitichun Jehoiakim apu apate toh alumkhomin, achapa Jehoiachin ama khelin alengchang tai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chuin Egypt lengpa chu agama konin ahungkit tapoi: ajehchu Babylon lengpan Egypt vapidunga kona Euphrates vadunglen gei, Egypt lengpa gamhop jouse alah ahitai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jehoiachin chu alengchan patnin kum somle kumget ahin, chule Jerusalem'a lhathum alengchange. Chule anu minchu Nehusta ahin, Jerusalem'a um Elnathan chanu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chuin aman apa thilbol jouse dungjuijin Pakai mitmun thilse jeng abolin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hiche laichun Babylon lengpa Nebuchadnezzar sohpa Jerusalem dounan ahung touvin, khopi chu aumkul taovin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chuin Babylon lengpa Nebuchadnezzar khopi doudinga chu ahungleh, asohten anaumchah taovin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chuin Judah lengpa Jehoiachin chu ama le anu, asohte, amilenho, avaipoho toh Babylon lengpa henga achedoh-un; chuin alengchan kumget lhinin Babylon lengpan sohchangin akaitai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chuin Pakaiyin anasei bangchun, Pakai in'a goujouse le leng in'a goujouse chu hiche mun'a konchun apodoh-in, Pakai houin'a Israelte lengpa Solomon'in sana kong leh bel anasem jouse chu avokeh sohkeijin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chuin Jerusalem'a mijouse, milen jouse, mihatle mihang jouse chu gal hing sangsom jen akaijin, khutthem jousele thih khengho jouse chu apuimang soh helin: gamsunga chun mipi avaicha dehho tailou koimacha aumtapoi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chuin Jehoiachin chu Babylon'a apui mangin, chule lengpa nu, lengpa jiteho, avaipoho, chule chuche gama mihat ho chu Jerusalem'a konin gal hingin Babylon'a akaitai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chule pasal hatjouse chu sangsagi jen, khutthemhole thih khengho sangkhat ahiuvin, amaho chu mihat le gal bolthei cheh ahiuvin, Babylon lengpan gal hingin Babylon'a akaitai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chuin Babylon lengpan Jehoiachin pa sopipa Mattaniah chu ama khelin alengchan sah-in, amin akhelpeh-in Zedekiah asahtai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zedekiah alengchan patnin kum somni le kum khat ahin, Jerusalem'a kum somle kum khat alengchange, chule anu minchu Hamutal ahin, Libnah kho-a Jeremiah chanu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chule Jehoiakim'in anabol bangin Pakai mitmun thilphalou jeng anabolin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ajehchu Pakai lunghan na-a kona Jerusalem le Judah gamsung chu a-angsunga kona apaidoh kahse-a chuti chu soh-a ahi. Chuin Zedekiah chu Babylon lengpa dounan akiphin tan ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chuin Zedekiah lengchan kal kum ko na, lha somna, chuche lha nisom na-in ahitin ahi, Babylon lengpa Nebuchadnezzar chu, amale asepaite toh Jerusalem dounan ahung konun, pal akai khumun, akimvela kul akai khumun ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zedekiah lengpa lengchan kal kum somle kum khat na-in, khopi chu aum kimvel taove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chuin lha lina ni ko nichun khopi-a chun kel alhan, gamsung miho dingin an himhim aumtapoi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chuin khopi chu asukeh-un, galsatmi jouse chu lengpa honna kulbang ni kikah lampia chun jan-in ajamun; (tun Chaldea te chun khopi chu aum khumu ahin,) chuin lengpa chu phaicham lampi lama chun achen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chuin Chaldea sepaihon lengpa chu anung delun, Jericho phaichama aphapa taovin; asepaite jouse chu ama-a konin akithecheh taove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hitichun lengpa chu amanun, Babylon lengpa henga Riblah'a apuitouvun; achungthu atan taove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chuin amahon Zedekiah chapate chu ama mitmu tah-in athatnun, chule Zedekiah chu amit akaldoh-un, sum-eng khaovin akanun, Babylon lama apuitaove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chuin Babylon lengpa Nebuchadnezzar lengchan kal kum somle kumko na, alha ngana, chuche lha nisagi nichun, Babylon lengpa sohpa vetup ho gal lamkai Nebuzaradan chu Jerusalem'a ahungin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pakai in le lengpa in, chule Jerusalem'a injouse le milentakip in chu meijin ahallha gamtan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chuin vetup vaipopa henga um chaldea sepai jouse chun, Jerusalem kimvela kulbangho chu asuchim gam taove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tun khopi sunga kidalha mipi dangho, chule Babylon lengpa henga kona jammangho, chule amoh tamtah ho chu vetuploi lamkai Nebuzaradan'in apuimang sohtai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahinla gamsunga mivaichaho chu vetup loi lamkaipa chun lengpilei lhouding le louboldin adalha tai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chuin Pakai insunga sum-eng khomho, chule twikongho, Pakai insunga sum-eng twidol, chule atunna sum-eng ho chu Babylon'a apotaove.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chule bel ho, vutlonaho, chaicheho, thihkheho, chule sum-enga kisem um le bel jouse chu amahon apomang taovin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chule khangbelho, sumlheng ho, chule chutobang thilho chu, sana chu sana-in, dangka chu dangka-in ngahtup gallamkai pan apomangtai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Solomon in Pakai in dinga anasem khom ni, twidol khat, chule atunna, umle bel ho jouse sum-eng chu tejougol ahipoi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khompi khat sanje chu tong somle tong get ahin, achunga aluboh chu sum-eng ahi; aluboh sanje chu tong thum ahin, chule aluboh chung kimvel chu kolbuthei lim kigeipol chitchetna, ajepna chu sum-eng jeng hija ahi. Hiche tobangma-a hi khompi nina-a jong chu akigeipol chitchet uma ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chuin ngahtup vaipopa chun thempu chungnung Seraiah, thempu nina Zephaniah, chule kotngah thumho chu amanin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chule aman khopi sunga galbolho chunga vaipo toh, khopi sunga lengpa anga ana umjing mi nga toh, gamsunga mipi ho min sunlutji janelho lekhasun pipuipa toh, khopisunga um gamsung mipilah a mi somgup toh amanin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chuin ngahtup vaipo Nebuzaradan'in amaho chu akaijin, Riblah'a Babylon lengpa henga apuitai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chuin Babylon lengpan amaho chu Hamath gamsunga um Riblah'a mun'a chun amaho chu athat gamin ahi. Hitichun Judah chu agamuva konin apuimangtai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chule Babylon lengpa Nebuchadnezzar'in adalhah, Judah gama umden hoding chun, aman Shaphan chapa Ahikam chapa Gedaliah chu achunguva gamvaipo din asem peh-in ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chuin galsat lamkaiho jouse, amahole amiteuvin Babylon lengpan Gedaliah chu gamvaipodin asemtai ti ajah phatnun, Nethaniah chapa Ishmael, Careah chapa Johanan, Netophah mi Tanhumeth chapa Seraiah, Maachath mi chapa Jaazaniah amahole amiteu chu Mizpah'a Gadaliah henga ahunguvin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chuin Gedaliah amahole amiteu henga akihahselin, ajah uvah, Chaldea ho soh hiding kicha hih-un; gamsunga chun chengun lang Babylon lengpa jenmaijun; chutile nangho dinga thilpha hiding ahi, ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahinla lha sagina-in ahitin ahi, lengte chilhah-a kon Elisha chapa Nethania chapa Ishmael chu pasal somtoh ahungin, Gedaliah le Mizpah'a aumpi Judah tele Chaldea te chu anokhumun athat taovin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chuin mijouse, alen aneo, chule galsat vaipoho, akipatnun Egypt'a ahungtaove; ajehchu Chaldea te chu akichatnu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chuin ahitin ahi, Judah lengpa Jehoiachin sohchan kal kum somthumna, lha somle lhanina, nisomni le sagini na-in, Babylon lengpa Evil-merodach ahung lengchan kum kipat chun, Judah lengpa Jehoiachin chu songkul'a konin alhadoh tan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chule ahenga lungsetna neitah-in thu aseijin, Babylon'a amatoh umkhom lengho jouselaltouna vuma chun ama laltouna adosangpeh-in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Asongkul von akhelpeh-in, ahinkho lhumkeijin a-anga an anejom jingtan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Chule alo chu ahile, lengpan niseh-in a-an nehding ape jingin, ahinkho lhumkeijin niseh-in achang neijin ape jingin ahi.
  </para>
</usx>
